(5186526, 754843, 81362, '<td valign="top">The repeating circular patterns and mysterious central substance make a great combination. I''m hoping you''ll provide details. From a compositional standpoint, the background of multicolor straight lines takes my eye repeatedly away from the subject and out of the picture - a dark solid background might have avoided that pitfall.</td>', 'The repeating circular patterns and mysterious central substance make a great combination. I''m hoping you''ll provide details. From a compositional standpoint, the background of multicolor straight lines takes my eye repeatedly away from the subject and out of the picture - a dark solid background might have avoided that pitfall.', '2009-01-12 08:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5186527, 754757, 43774, '<td valign="top">Excellent colours, I like the diagonal composition. And an interesting subject for sure!</td>', 'Excellent colours, I like the diagonal composition. And an interesting subject for sure!', '2009-01-12 08:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5186530, 755307, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very cool.....interesting looking creature, good composition and colours.</td>', 'Very cool.....interesting looking creature, good composition and colours.', '2009-01-12 08:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
