(5187207, 753944, 75192, '<td valign="top">This is.... there are no other words for it...... really pretty. The tones, the almost perfect symmetry, the colours, the focus, the composition - all very good.<br/> <br/>My only criticisms are from a symmetrical aspect the bottom of the flower is off kilter, which is a shame. Also, I feel the shot could have been straighter. It seems to be balanced more heavily on the left.<br/> <br/>However, this is still an excellent shot, which deserves a top score.</td>', 'This is.... there are no other words for it...... really pretty. The tones, the almost perfect symmetry, the colours, the focus, the composition - all very good. My only criticisms are from a symmetrical aspect the bottom of the flower is off kilter, which is a shame. Also, I feel the shot could have been straighter. It seems to be balanced more heavily on the left. However, this is still an excellent shot, which deserves a top score.', '2009-01-12 14:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
