(5187315, 754892, 49954, '<td valign="top">Wow... half moon tonight!  Sharp, nice processing,</td>', 'Wow... half moon tonight!  Sharp, nice processing,', '2009-01-12 14:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187317, 755370, 55956, '<td valign="top">wow great colours and sharpness..... and impressive subject!</td>', 'wow great colours and sharpness..... and impressive subject!', '2009-01-12 14:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187320, 754483, 75192, '<td valign="top">I think owls are wonderful creatures, very intriguing birds. <br/> <br/>This shot certainly dips out of the ''generic'' owl photo pose... and although I do feel sorry for whatever (I''m presuming another bird *shiver*) it''s just eaten, it does add depth and interest to the shot.</td>', 'I think owls are wonderful creatures, very intriguing birds.  This shot certainly dips out of the ''generic'' owl photo pose... and although I do feel sorry for whatever (I''m presuming another bird *shiver*) it''s just eaten, it does add depth and interest to the shot.', '2009-01-12 14:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187322, 755307, 75192, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh and the fish is colourful and shot well in terms of focus and composition.</td>', 'Nice bokeh and the fish is colourful and shot well in terms of focus and composition.', '2009-01-12 14:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187323, 754924, 49954, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, but odd angle...</td>', 'Nice lighting, but odd angle...', '2009-01-12 14:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187327, 754789, 75192, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting picture. A good take on the challenge I think. The focus is rightly so on the curly stem.... and I love the purples tones in this. I think I would have liked this better if the purple tones stayed, the green was turned into a grey and the white curly stem stayed white.... maybe try it and see what you come up with? :)</td>', 'This is an interesting picture. A good take on the challenge I think. The focus is rightly so on the curly stem.... and I love the purples tones in this. I think I would have liked this better if the purple tones stayed, the green was turned into a grey and the white curly stem stayed white.... maybe try it and see what you come up with? :)', '2009-01-12 14:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187335, 755051, 75192, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous calf. It looks so incredibly sad. Its speckled nose is beyond adorable and the softness around its mouth are so strokable. Its hair is soft too, which really makes you feel maternal towards it..... he/she looks so sad and so cute that I just wanted to hug him/her! <br/> <br/>I hope he/she has a happy life.... and is walking around chewing the cud for a long, long time to come. <br/> <br/>An excellent shot.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous calf. It looks so incredibly sad. Its speckled nose is beyond adorable and the softness around its mouth are so strokable. Its hair is soft too, which really makes you feel maternal towards it..... he/she looks so sad and so cute that I just wanted to hug him/her!  I hope he/she has a happy life.... and is walking around chewing the cud for a long, long time to come.  An excellent shot.', '2009-01-12 14:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187336, 753422, 75192, '<td valign="top">A great action shot. Horses really do run for the joy of it!</td>', 'A great action shot. Horses really do run for the joy of it!', '2009-01-12 14:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187337, 753595, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2009-01-12 14:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187338, 755250, 75192, '<td valign="top">This is a great abstract.  You''ve captured the shadows perfectly and the tones are really brought out by the black and white colours. Excellent work.</td>', 'This is a great abstract.  You''ve captured the shadows perfectly and the tones are really brought out by the black and white colours. Excellent work.', '2009-01-12 14:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187341, 755285, 60698, '<td valign="top">Adorable and funny! Love the expression. Great photo!</td>', 'Adorable and funny! Love the expression. Great photo!', '2009-01-12 14:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187346, 753796, 75192, '<td valign="top">Nice nature shot. The birdie is clear and in focus and... eating wood? Ha ha, how cute! I hope you gave him some nuts! <br/> <br/>A great bokeh effect in the background. An excellent shot. His shadow is balanced out by the shadow to the right... without this extra shadow it would have looked out of place somewhat. Well done!</td>', 'Nice nature shot. The birdie is clear and in focus and... eating wood? Ha ha, how cute! I hope you gave him some nuts!  A great bokeh effect in the background. An excellent shot. His shadow is balanced out by the shadow to the right... without this extra shadow it would have looked out of place somewhat. Well done!', '2009-01-12 14:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187349, 753941, 75192, '<td valign="top">Seriously sexy young lady. The sort of body I aspire to have!!! I want to learn to pole dance too, but this is not about me! <br/> <br/>The shot is in focus and the lighting is perfect. Her pose is glamourous and sensual and would have been heightened by her looking into the camera, but as this is a candid, I know you have to work with what you got. <br/> <br/>A great shot, well done.</td>', 'Seriously sexy young lady. The sort of body I aspire to have!!! I want to learn to pole dance too, but this is not about me!  The shot is in focus and the lighting is perfect. Her pose is glamourous and sensual and would have been heightened by her looking into the camera, but as this is a candid, I know you have to work with what you got.  A great shot, well done.', '2009-01-12 15:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
