(5188347, 754475, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is mesmerizing to say the least.  I love the pinhole pupils - which just make that stare more intense, yet the overall softness of the image gives that king of beasts an almost fairy tale appearance.  I love the way the whiskers jump out, strong and bristly against the otherwise soft feel of it.  Not at all expected.  I like it very much. 8</td>', 'This is mesmerizing to say the least.  I love the pinhole pupils - which just make that stare more intense, yet the overall softness of the image gives that king of beasts an almost fairy tale appearance.  I love the way the whiskers jump out, strong and bristly against the otherwise soft feel of it.  Not at all expected.  I like it very much. 8', '2009-01-12 22:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188349, 754770, 32345, '<td valign="top">"LIFE SUCH AS IT IS", well that can be right for some peoples but it''s not the case for everybody :)<br/> <br/>I think that your picture will be voted down mainly because there''s no areas that are in focus... (is that the right way to say it in english?)<br/> <br/>P.S. I''m not voting this challenge, I''m just giving some comments :)</td>', '"LIFE SUCH AS IT IS", well that can be right for some peoples but it''s not the case for everybody :) I think that your picture will be voted down mainly because there''s no areas that are in focus... (is that the right way to say it in english?) P.S. I''m not voting this challenge, I''m just giving some comments :)', '2009-01-12 22:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188351, 755185, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has the classic "awwww" factor for sure.  I love that the mare is looking at you as the colt is completely lost in his afternoon snack. I wish that there were a bit more negative space around them, but the scene and the DOF are spot on. :~)</td>', 'This has the classic "awwww" factor for sure.  I love that the mare is looking at you as the colt is completely lost in his afternoon snack. I wish that there were a bit more negative space around them, but the scene and the DOF are spot on. :~)', '2009-01-12 22:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
