(5188587, 755351, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is almost like one of those terrible Sears family posed shots :-)  Very funny composition.</td>', 'This is almost like one of those terrible Sears family posed shots :-)  Very funny composition.', '2009-01-13 02:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188588, 753615, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very powerful image.  Great isolation.  May be too sad to place well, but I hope it makes the top 10.</td>', 'Very powerful image.  Great isolation.  May be too sad to place well, but I hope it makes the top 10.', '2009-01-13 02:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188589, 755340, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, and the different textures.  The back window, though an interesting texture, is too distracting.  Frosted rather than dirty glass may have improved this shot.  I would have cloned out the little imperfections on the counter as well.  They don''t add to the shot.  But the blue and green look great.</td>', 'I love the colors, and the different textures.  The back window, though an interesting texture, is too distracting.  Frosted rather than dirty glass may have improved this shot.  I would have cloned out the little imperfections on the counter as well.  They don''t add to the shot.  But the blue and green look great.', '2009-01-13 02:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188590, 755138, 96751, '<td valign="top">Another top 10 shot.  What a character.  What make-up!  If only that what thing wasn''t behind him...</td>', 'Another top 10 shot.  What a character.  What make-up!  If only that what thing wasn''t behind him...', '2009-01-13 02:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188591, 755177, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wish it was clearer at the end of the walk.  The front bride is pretty sharp, bht the rest of the shot is a bit blurred.  Not perspective.</td>', 'Wish it was clearer at the end of the walk.  The front bride is pretty sharp, bht the rest of the shot is a bit blurred.  Not perspective.', '2009-01-13 02:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188592, 755250, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  Also think it''ll make the top 10.  But I''m not often right.  Just sometimes :-)  Incredible use of shadows, the protective cages accentuate the field perfectly, the light tones all work together.  Love the b/w.  MAYBE would have cropped a little more off the bottom.</td>', 'Love this shot.  Also think it''ll make the top 10.  But I''m not often right.  Just sometimes :-)  Incredible use of shadows, the protective cages accentuate the field perfectly, the light tones all work together.  Love the b/w.  MAYBE would have cropped a little more off the bottom.', '2009-01-13 02:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188633, 754363, 90173, '<td valign="top">wow...great moment</td>', 'wow...great moment', '2009-01-13 04:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188642, 755290, 63633, '<td valign="top">This has great potential, but lacks impact for some reason, and I''m trying to put my finger on what it is.<br/> <br/>- I think the loss of detail in the dress is one thing, plus the composition is missing something. <br/>- The edge of the lake looks like it''s cutting her head off, which shouldn''t make a difference but it does. <br/>- I think the subject is the lady, and the lake has become a distracting element.  <br/>- The light is a bit harsh, creating unflattering shadows on her face<br/>- The tonal range is a bit flat - lots of mid-greys and blacks, not many highlights.<br/> <br/>Sorry for being critical. My own entry is flagging, and I wish people would try to help me understand why, so hopefully this is helpful to you.</td>', 'This has great potential, but lacks impact for some reason, and I''m trying to put my finger on what it is. - I think the loss of detail in the dress is one thing, plus the composition is missing something. - The edge of the lake looks like it''s cutting her head off, which shouldn''t make a difference but it does. - I think the subject is the lady, and the lake has become a distracting element.  - The light is a bit harsh, creating unflattering shadows on her face- The tonal range is a bit flat - lots of mid-greys and blacks, not many highlights. Sorry for being critical. My own entry is flagging, and I wish people would try to help me understand why, so hopefully this is helpful to you.', '2009-01-13 04:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188643, 755401, 63633, '<td valign="top">The isolation of the bulb is a bit clumsy (I can see the feathering), but overall I like it.</td>', 'The isolation of the bulb is a bit clumsy (I can see the feathering), but overall I like it.', '2009-01-13 04:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188644, 755340, 63633, '<td valign="top">Colours are lovely and vibrant, but the composition really doesn''t do much for me. Love the frosted glass backdrop.</td>', 'Colours are lovely and vibrant, but the composition really doesn''t do much for me. Love the frosted glass backdrop.', '2009-01-13 05:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188682, 755372, 92577, '<td valign="top">great fun</td>', 'great fun', '2009-01-13 06:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
