(5188690, 753615, 92577, '<td valign="top">intriguing mystery figure means I almost missed the nonchalant hound. ( I think those two figures would make the picture by themselves, which makes the seated chap a bit of an intrusion - just sharing my thoughts - good luck<br/> <br/>(Portugal?)</td>', 'intriguing mystery figure means I almost missed the nonchalant hound. ( I think those two figures would make the picture by themselves, which makes the seated chap a bit of an intrusion - just sharing my thoughts - good luck (Portugal?)', '2009-01-13 06:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
