(5188709, 754741, 69368, '<td valign="top">oh, this is fantastic! Tones are just perfect and the dog looks so cute! Wonderful dog-portrait. You''ve done a great job!</td>', 'oh, this is fantastic! Tones are just perfect and the dog looks so cute! Wonderful dog-portrait. You''ve done a great job!', '2009-01-13 07:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188710, 755198, 69368, '<td valign="top">really good portrait. Wonderful clarity and sharpness.</td>', 'really good portrait. Wonderful clarity and sharpness.', '2009-01-13 07:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188715, 754058, 92577, '<td valign="top">very processed - it looks like one of those paintings on velvet if you''ve ever seen one. That''s not to say I don''t like it - I do - good luck.<br/>(SandyP?)</td>', 'very processed - it looks like one of those paintings on velvet if you''ve ever seen one. That''s not to say I don''t like it - I do - good luck.(SandyP?)', '2009-01-13 07:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188719, 755342, 92296, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you''re not Australian.  Your title might mean something different - but similar - down there.</td>', 'I''m guessing you''re not Australian.  Your title might mean something different - but similar - down there.', '2009-01-13 07:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188721, 754924, 92296, '<td valign="top">Love the light and the portrait.  Not sure the posed posture matches the title - which suggests something more random to me. 7</td>', 'Love the light and the portrait.  Not sure the posed posture matches the title - which suggests something more random to me. 7', '2009-01-13 07:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188724, 755356, 69368, '<td valign="top">oh, I want this! Please, can you send this lovely little one to me?<br/>Really nice portrait! Background-color works well.</td>', 'oh, I want this! Please, can you send this lovely little one to me?Really nice portrait! Background-color works well.', '2009-01-13 07:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188744, 755126, 75192, '<td valign="top">This is a good crisp shot. What I like most about it is his expression. He seems to be almost peeking at the viewer. <br/> <br/>The focus is spot on and the border not too imposing.</td>', 'This is a good crisp shot. What I like most about it is his expression. He seems to be almost peeking at the viewer.  The focus is spot on and the border not too imposing.', '2009-01-13 08:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188745, 754437, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait; light looks very soft and natural.  I might have cropped tighter on the bottom to get rid of the shirt design and more importantly get his eyes close to (or on) a rule of thirds line.  The image feels more powerful to me cropped that way.</td>', 'Nice portrait; light looks very soft and natural.  I might have cropped tighter on the bottom to get rid of the shirt design and more importantly get his eyes close to (or on) a rule of thirds line.  The image feels more powerful to me cropped that way.', '2009-01-13 08:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188746, 755263, 75192, '<td valign="top">A lovely baby shot. I think the black background was the right choice and the placement of the baby within the shot is good compostionally. I do think that the reds could have been toned down though, and that it may have been a stronger piece as a black and white portrait.</td>', 'A lovely baby shot. I think the black background was the right choice and the placement of the baby within the shot is good compostionally. I do think that the reds could have been toned down though, and that it may have been a stronger piece as a black and white portrait.', '2009-01-13 08:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188747, 754250, 75192, '<td valign="top">This is a creative take on the challenge, which is to be admired. I like the black and white as I think emotive portraits such as this are better in black and white tones. However, I do feel that the contrast could have been less so and the shot brightned up a bit. Not sure about the circular shadowing at the top either. Good focus.</td>', 'This is a creative take on the challenge, which is to be admired. I like the black and white as I think emotive portraits such as this are better in black and white tones. However, I do feel that the contrast could have been less so and the shot brightned up a bit. Not sure about the circular shadowing at the top either. Good focus.', '2009-01-13 08:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188753, 754924, 75192, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, especially her pose. And the model has very delicate features. I don''t think the lighting is quite right though and this does have an effect on the overall shot. Also, her hand is too close to the top of the frame which makes the composition seem a bit squiffy. I love the black and white tones and the focus.</td>', 'I like this shot, especially her pose. And the model has very delicate features. I don''t think the lighting is quite right though and this does have an effect on the overall shot. Also, her hand is too close to the top of the frame which makes the composition seem a bit squiffy. I love the black and white tones and the focus.', '2009-01-13 08:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188754, 753753, 75192, '<td valign="top">This is a nice wintry shot. It wouldn''t look out of place on a Christmas card!</td>', 'This is a nice wintry shot. It wouldn''t look out of place on a Christmas card!', '2009-01-13 08:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188755, 754969, 75192, '<td valign="top">I bet he was fast! This is a good crisp, in focus shot. You did well. The textures in the sand are good too, and the rock adds something compositionally to the photo.</td>', 'I bet he was fast! This is a good crisp, in focus shot. You did well. The textures in the sand are good too, and the rock adds something compositionally to the photo.', '2009-01-13 08:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188756, 755052, 75192, '<td valign="top">Wonderful abstract, the in-focus part of the photo is excellent. It shows the best of the rose branch in colour and texture, and this is accentuated by the rain drops. You were right to choose a black background. <br/> <br/>I think you will lose points for the graininess in the top right hand corner of the picture. Some graininess/noise is good if executed correctly, but I do feel there is too much noise and colour pollution in this particular shot.</td>', 'Wonderful abstract, the in-focus part of the photo is excellent. It shows the best of the rose branch in colour and texture, and this is accentuated by the rain drops. You were right to choose a black background.  I think you will lose points for the graininess in the top right hand corner of the picture. Some graininess/noise is good if executed correctly, but I do feel there is too much noise and colour pollution in this particular shot.', '2009-01-13 08:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188757, 755269, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty kitty who looks well cared for, if a bit annoyed with those narrowed eyes.  I would crop much tighter and get the eyes on a rule of thirds, and then clean up the wetness under the eye and the light reflection on the left pupil.  There isn''t much of a catchlight in the eyes so if the cat was cooperative I''d move a light around to try and get a nice catchlight.  It adds a great deal of life (so to speak) to a pet portrait.</td>', 'Pretty kitty who looks well cared for, if a bit annoyed with those narrowed eyes.  I would crop much tighter and get the eyes on a rule of thirds, and then clean up the wetness under the eye and the light reflection on the left pupil.  There isn''t much of a catchlight in the eyes so if the cat was cooperative I''d move a light around to try and get a nice catchlight.  It adds a great deal of life (so to speak) to a pet portrait.', '2009-01-13 08:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188759, 755043, 75192, '<td valign="top">To begin with this looks like a black and white shot, but I see the sunset tones at the bottom, so I know it''s not! The tree is good as a silhouette. I think the clouds are interesting, but for some reason (and this is only in my view) they seem to detract from the shot slightly... maybe it''s the fact that they alsmost seem embossed.</td>', 'To begin with this looks like a black and white shot, but I see the sunset tones at the bottom, so I know it''s not! The tree is good as a silhouette. I think the clouds are interesting, but for some reason (and this is only in my view) they seem to detract from the shot slightly... maybe it''s the fact that they alsmost seem embossed.', '2009-01-13 08:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188765, 755403, 65234, '<td valign="top">The lady, in particular, looks joyful with that swirling skirt and hair and big smile.  Her partner looks less involved in the dancing.  Image is very contrasty; not sure if I like that as much as a softer light.</td>', 'The lady, in particular, looks joyful with that swirling skirt and hair and big smile.  Her partner looks less involved in the dancing.  Image is very contrasty; not sure if I like that as much as a softer light.', '2009-01-13 08:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188766, 753915, 75192, '<td valign="top">This a nice little macro with some good use of negative space,  but it does seem slightly out of focus/the creature doesn''t seem strong enough to carry the shot as a whole.</td>', 'This a nice little macro with some good use of negative space,  but it does seem slightly out of focus/the creature doesn''t seem strong enough to carry the shot as a whole.', '2009-01-13 08:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188767, 754766, 75192, '<td valign="top">This is a nice wildlife shot and you''ve got him in focus pefectly. Good bokeh.</td>', 'This is a nice wildlife shot and you''ve got him in focus pefectly. Good bokeh.', '2009-01-13 08:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188768, 755285, 75192, '<td valign="top">This would make a good lolcat edition!</td>', 'This would make a good lolcat edition!', '2009-01-13 08:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188769, 755351, 75192, '<td valign="top">A nice bird shot with some good textures on the wood. I like the colours.</td>', 'A nice bird shot with some good textures on the wood. I like the colours.', '2009-01-13 08:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188770, 755309, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw, cute little toddler!  The softness on her feet reminds me of the unsteadiness of kids at that stage, who aren''t always quite sure where their feet are.  Not sure I like the green and yellow object being there as I keep looking to see what it is.  I think I might have cloned it out of existence ;-)</td>', 'Aw, cute little toddler!  The softness on her feet reminds me of the unsteadiness of kids at that stage, who aren''t always quite sure where their feet are.  Not sure I like the green and yellow object being there as I keep looking to see what it is.  I think I might have cloned it out of existence ;-)', '2009-01-13 08:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188773, 755400, 75192, '<td valign="top">A cute puppy photo. His collar seems too distracting though and I think it wouldn have been a stronger picture with a more generous crop, and in black and white tones. The focus is good on the face, but I might have gone for more overall focus on the body too. A nice shot all in all though.</td>', 'A cute puppy photo. His collar seems too distracting though and I think it wouldn have been a stronger picture with a more generous crop, and in black and white tones. The focus is good on the face, but I might have gone for more overall focus on the body too. A nice shot all in all though.', '2009-01-13 08:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188776, 754803, 75192, '<td valign="top">A cute little furry! I think I would have liked to have seen more of his face though - which I know might have been harder to capture!</td>', 'A cute little furry! I think I would have liked to have seen more of his face though - which I know might have been harder to capture!', '2009-01-13 08:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188778, 755225, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow DOF and lighting.  Colors are a little oversaturated on my screen; I think I''d bring the greens down a bit, if not the whole thing.  There is a dark halo around the berry which I''ve noticed on some of my shots when I have bright red against bright green.  It almost looks like it was outlined.  I might try some judicious cloning to get rid of it.</td>', 'I like the shallow DOF and lighting.  Colors are a little oversaturated on my screen; I think I''d bring the greens down a bit, if not the whole thing.  There is a dark halo around the berry which I''ve noticed on some of my shots when I have bright red against bright green.  It almost looks like it was outlined.  I might try some judicious cloning to get rid of it.', '2009-01-13 08:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188782, 754250, 65234, '<td valign="top">Well, that''s depressing :-(  A bit dark, but that''s appropriate for the subject.  I think I''d like it better if I couldn''t see houses in the background,maybe a closer crop and/or slightly different angle?  It would look more lonely that way.</td>', 'Well, that''s depressing :-(  A bit dark, but that''s appropriate for the subject.  I think I''d like it better if I couldn''t see houses in the background,maybe a closer crop and/or slightly different angle?  It would look more lonely that way.', '2009-01-13 08:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188784, 755060, 65234, '<td valign="top">Sweet image and the softness suits it well.</td>', 'Sweet image and the softness suits it well.', '2009-01-13 08:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188785, 755226, 75192, '<td valign="top">I like this because it''s creative and it does make you think "where was this taken". I like the hexagon of light. I don''t think that your shot matches your title though - in my opinion if it were my shot I would have focused more on either the couple being in love or more on the main single individual human, in terms of his lonliness. <br/> <br/>I like the black and white tones and the lighting.</td>', 'I like this because it''s creative and it does make you think "where was this taken". I like the hexagon of light. I don''t think that your shot matches your title though - in my opinion if it were my shot I would have focused more on either the couple being in love or more on the main single individual human, in terms of his lonliness.  I like the black and white tones and the lighting.', '2009-01-13 08:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188786, 755169, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting low clouds; the trees and hikers look very solid in comparison.</td>', 'Interesting low clouds; the trees and hikers look very solid in comparison.', '2009-01-13 08:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188787, 755356, 75192, '<td valign="top">This is a good puppy shot. I like the green background and the textures, but it''s a little bit too over-exposed/processed.</td>', 'This is a good puppy shot. I like the green background and the textures, but it''s a little bit too over-exposed/processed.', '2009-01-13 08:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188788, 755335, 75192, '<td valign="top">A good abstract and beautiful colours. Some fantastic bokeh, but I think the focus is not quite there on the flower as a whole.</td>', 'A good abstract and beautiful colours. Some fantastic bokeh, but I think the focus is not quite there on the flower as a whole.', '2009-01-13 08:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188789, 755138, 75192, '<td valign="top">This is a good candid and he''s wearing a fantastic outfit. It seems a bit over-saturated though.</td>', 'This is a good candid and he''s wearing a fantastic outfit. It seems a bit over-saturated though.', '2009-01-13 08:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188791, 754930, 75192, '<td valign="top">A cute picture and a nice moment to capture, it does seem a bit more like a snapshot though, which I think is down to the lighting.</td>', 'A cute picture and a nice moment to capture, it does seem a bit more like a snapshot though, which I think is down to the lighting.', '2009-01-13 08:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188793, 754757, 75192, '<td valign="top">A good macro with some good bokeh. Nice textures and vibrant colours.</td>', 'A good macro with some good bokeh. Nice textures and vibrant colours.', '2009-01-13 08:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188796, 755124, 75192, '<td valign="top">A good candid and nice colours. I might have tried to capture it in portrait rather than landcape, I think it might have set a stronger composition.</td>', 'A good candid and nice colours. I might have tried to capture it in portrait rather than landcape, I think it might have set a stronger composition.', '2009-01-13 08:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188801, 754954, 75192, '<td valign="top">A good macro with some nice bokeh! Spiders freak me out and this is no exception!</td>', 'A good macro with some nice bokeh! Spiders freak me out and this is no exception!', '2009-01-13 08:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188804, 755129, 75192, '<td valign="top">A good look on his face and I like the black and white tones - would this maybe have been better in colour though? A tighter crop may have been better too. Good focus and nice processing.</td>', 'A good look on his face and I like the black and white tones - would this maybe have been better in colour though? A tighter crop may have been better too. Good focus and nice processing.', '2009-01-13 08:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188806, 755204, 75192, '<td valign="top">A good wildlife capture.... shooting ducks is not easy! Pardon the pun! <br/> <br/>Good colours and good focus.</td>', 'A good wildlife capture.... shooting ducks is not easy! Pardon the pun!  Good colours and good focus.', '2009-01-13 08:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188811, 755256, 73235, '<td valign="top">very cute shot. the tongue coming out of the mouth adds so much life.</td>', 'very cute shot. the tongue coming out of the mouth adds so much life.', '2009-01-13 08:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188815, 755289, 73235, '<td valign="top">lots of details in all the textures you captured (the skin, the sweaters). good portrait.</td>', 'lots of details in all the textures you captured (the skin, the sweaters). good portrait.', '2009-01-13 08:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188818, 755135, 65234, '<td valign="top">Much detritus of human life and some hardy vegetation.  It feels very busy and I''m not sure if the point is that people are inconsiderate of the environment or that some plants can grow in unfriendly places or something else entirely.</td>', 'Much detritus of human life and some hardy vegetation.  It feels very busy and I''m not sure if the point is that people are inconsiderate of the environment or that some plants can grow in unfriendly places or something else entirely.', '2009-01-13 08:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188825, 755351, 73235, '<td valign="top">2 commnets jumo right into my mind: the moss ont he wodden beams is very interesting but it draws my view away from the bird. the second one: you oversharpened your picture. look at the bird and you will find a clearly visible halo in the contrast areas between bird and the background. This oversharpening makes the moss stand out even more, as it appears so crisp and detailed. Focus is right on, nice bokeh supporting the color scheme.</td>', '2 commnets jumo right into my mind: the moss ont he wodden beams is very interesting but it draws my view away from the bird. the second one: you oversharpened your picture. look at the bird and you will find a clearly visible halo in the contrast areas between bird and the background. This oversharpening makes the moss stand out even more, as it appears so crisp and detailed. Focus is right on, nice bokeh supporting the color scheme.', '2009-01-13 08:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188828, 754978, 65234, '<td valign="top">I thought the subject was fishing till I read the title.  The sea and rocks are impressively violent and solid, respectively.  I suspect a different pose from the subject would look more despairing to me; as it is he''s pointed at a little rock and looks to be idly contemplating it.  From this distance body language needs to be extreme to convey an emotion, I think.  If I ignore the title the subject still looks kind of random and inconsequential.</td>', 'I thought the subject was fishing till I read the title.  The sea and rocks are impressively violent and solid, respectively.  I suspect a different pose from the subject would look more despairing to me; as it is he''s pointed at a little rock and looks to be idly contemplating it.  From this distance body language needs to be extreme to convey an emotion, I think.  If I ignore the title the subject still looks kind of random and inconsequential.', '2009-01-13 08:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188831, 755324, 73235, '<td valign="top">I always like reflections off water. There is nothing real exiting going on in your picture.</td>', 'I always like reflections off water. There is nothing real exiting going on in your picture.', '2009-01-13 08:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188833, 755296, 65234, '<td valign="top">Had to Google "gluwine" ;-)  Looks like a chaotically happy scene.</td>', 'Had to Google "gluwine" ;-)  Looks like a chaotically happy scene.', '2009-01-13 08:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188838, 754987, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like an angry start to the week =:-O  Very sharp and I like the light for the most part.  One highlight on the left shoulder keeps grabbing my eye; I think I would have toned that down and/or softened its edges.</td>', 'Looks like an angry start to the week =:-O  Very sharp and I like the light for the most part.  One highlight on the left shoulder keeps grabbing my eye; I think I would have toned that down and/or softened its edges.', '2009-01-13 08:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188841, 754892, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective and I love the color and clarity of the water.  Not such a big fan of the bathing suit tucked into the rear, there.  It''s like an accident scene I don''t want to look at but it keeps drawing my eye.  I think I would have gone with altering reality and cloning out that line.</td>', 'Interesting perspective and I love the color and clarity of the water.  Not such a big fan of the bathing suit tucked into the rear, there.  It''s like an accident scene I don''t want to look at but it keeps drawing my eye.  I think I would have gone with altering reality and cloning out that line.', '2009-01-13 09:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188847, 754004, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw, great capture, and B&amp;W is a good processing choice for this.  I''d like a few less shadows on (presumably) Grandpa; maybe some levels, dodging and cloning, or re-shoot with the light moved.  But the expressions are wonderful :-)</td>', 'Aw, great capture, and B&W is a good processing choice for this.  I''d like a few less shadows on (presumably) Grandpa; maybe some levels, dodging and cloning, or re-shoot with the light moved.  But the expressions are wonderful :-)', '2009-01-13 09:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188876, 754960, 65234, '<td valign="top">Blue tones certainly make this feel very cold and the leading line of ski tracks pulls me in.  Composition feels a little off to me, though, like it could use more foreground so it didn''t feel split half and half sky and ground.</td>', 'Blue tones certainly make this feel very cold and the leading line of ski tracks pulls me in.  Composition feels a little off to me, though, like it could use more foreground so it didn''t feel split half and half sky and ground.', '2009-01-13 09:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188888, 755209, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very punny.  Cacti look VERY sharp!</td>', 'Very punny.  Cacti look VERY sharp!', '2009-01-13 09:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188895, 755317, 65234, '<td valign="top">ROFL!  I could have lent you a real rabbit ;-)  Very clever idea.</td>', 'ROFL!  I could have lent you a real rabbit ;-)  Very clever idea.', '2009-01-13 09:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188897, 755221, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute; could use a bit more contrast.</td>', 'Cute; could use a bit more contrast.', '2009-01-13 09:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188899, 755325, 65234, '<td valign="top">Fun shot.  I think I''d prefer to be in the nice, warm enclosure!</td>', 'Fun shot.  I think I''d prefer to be in the nice, warm enclosure!', '2009-01-13 09:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188906, 755396, 65234, '<td valign="top">He needs more heads to be Cerberus.  He must be some other sort of demon dog.  Probably should be posing more menacingly to suit the processing.</td>', 'He needs more heads to be Cerberus.  He must be some other sort of demon dog.  Probably should be posing more menacingly to suit the processing.', '2009-01-13 09:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188908, 755360, 65234, '<td valign="top">Really great smiles; they look lovely and self-confident with their braces.</td>', 'Really great smiles; they look lovely and self-confident with their braces.', '2009-01-13 09:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188910, 755199, 65234, '<td valign="top">She looks like she just finished a temper tantrum with those bright red cheeks!  Watery eyes are beautifully reflective.</td>', 'She looks like she just finished a temper tantrum with those bright red cheeks!  Watery eyes are beautifully reflective.', '2009-01-13 09:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188920, 754933, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very handsome (or beautiful, as appropriate).  I''d move the dog a few feet more in front of the fence so the background blurred more.  With a biggish dog like this you need a fair amount of DOF to get the whole head in focus, and the fence color isn''t enough of a contrast to enhance the dog so I''d want to minimize the detail in this background.</td>', 'Very handsome (or beautiful, as appropriate).  I''d move the dog a few feet more in front of the fence so the background blurred more.  With a biggish dog like this you need a fair amount of DOF to get the whole head in focus, and the fence color isn''t enough of a contrast to enhance the dog so I''d want to minimize the detail in this background.', '2009-01-13 09:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188929, 755351, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely woodpecker; I don''t think I''ve ever seen one like it before.  Nice variety in life forms here.</td>', 'Lovely woodpecker; I don''t think I''ve ever seen one like it before.  Nice variety in life forms here.', '2009-01-13 09:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188935, 755372, 65234, '<td valign="top">The expressions are wonderful :-)  Yay for kids having fun in the snow!</td>', 'The expressions are wonderful :-)  Yay for kids having fun in the snow!', '2009-01-13 09:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188936, 754292, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great expression; makes me smile :-)</td>', 'Great expression; makes me smile :-)', '2009-01-13 09:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188942, 753917, 65234, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to realize that was a tombstone; I thought it was a hooded figure at first.  I like the little hint of color in the flowers to subtle emphasize their liveness.</td>', 'Took me a minute to realize that was a tombstone; I thought it was a hooded figure at first.  I like the little hint of color in the flowers to subtle emphasize their liveness.', '2009-01-13 10:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188946, 754687, 65234, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of the Princess Bride quote: "Life is pain, Highness.  Anyone who says differently is selling something."</td>', 'Makes me think of the Princess Bride quote: "Life is pain, Highness.  Anyone who says differently is selling something."', '2009-01-13 10:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188947, 754290, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great lighting!  The shadow amongst the stripes of the leaf is wonderful.</td>', 'Great lighting!  The shadow amongst the stripes of the leaf is wonderful.', '2009-01-13 10:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188949, 754632, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great light, very soft and golden.</td>', 'Great light, very soft and golden.', '2009-01-13 10:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188950, 754308, 65234, '<td valign="top">Too cute!  Softness works well for this baby.</td>', 'Too cute!  Softness works well for this baby.', '2009-01-13 10:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188952, 754483, 65234, '<td valign="top">Um, ew.  Well shot, but ew.</td>', 'Um, ew.  Well shot, but ew.', '2009-01-13 10:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188956, 755016, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very thought-provoking expression.  Image seems a little soft, like the shutter speed was a bit too slow.</td>', 'Very thought-provoking expression.  Image seems a little soft, like the shutter speed was a bit too slow.', '2009-01-13 10:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188958, 755285, 65234, '<td valign="top">LOL!  This belongs on a poster somewhere.</td>', 'LOL!  This belongs on a poster somewhere.', '2009-01-13 10:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188959, 753988, 73235, '<td valign="top">Oh man, just lost my lengthy comment for you. So I try to recreat it:<br/>a very nice smile ind deed. You model deserves a little more attention from your side:<br/>Lighting<br/>the flash you used could either be bounced off of some surface like the ceiling or a simple white paper. the flash could also be diffused by having a semitranspararent object between the flash and your model. THis will eliminate the harsh bright areas around the cheek bones, the nose, the teeth and the chin.<br/>Background<br/>the left part adds some environmental relation and supports your picture. the person on the right side though should not be in the frame at all. Your model deserves some more attention by you so the viewer can completely focus on her and not trying to figure out what the other person is doing in the picture.<br/>I guess I was able to recreate the lost comment :)<br/>BTW: focus is dead on, good detail in the hair, catch light in the eyes. THere are strong parts in your shot :)</td>', 'Oh man, just lost my lengthy comment for you. So I try to recreat it:a very nice smile ind deed. You model deserves a little more attention from your side:Lightingthe flash you used could either be bounced off of some surface like the ceiling or a simple white paper. the flash could also be diffused by having a semitranspararent object between the flash and your model. THis will eliminate the harsh bright areas around the cheek bones, the nose, the teeth and the chin.Backgroundthe left part adds some environmental relation and supports your picture. the person on the right side though should not be in the frame at all. Your model deserves some more attention by you so the viewer can completely focus on her and not trying to figure out what the other person is doing in the picture.I guess I was able to recreate the lost comment :)BTW: focus is dead on, good detail in the hair, catch light in the eyes. THere are strong parts in your shot :)', '2009-01-13 10:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188961, 755356, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great face :-)  Well lit and posed.  Processing seems a little harsh to me for such a sweet, soft-looking subject.  I think it''s the muted sort of color on the dog which looks rather unnatural for my taste.  Really, really cute expression, though; I do enjoy looking at it.</td>', 'Great face :-)  Well lit and posed.  Processing seems a little harsh to me for such a sweet, soft-looking subject.  I think it''s the muted sort of color on the dog which looks rather unnatural for my taste.  Really, really cute expression, though; I do enjoy looking at it.', '2009-01-13 10:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188963, 755071, 65234, '<td valign="top">LOL at the title ;-)  Calm pigeon in the busy whirlwind of city life.  nicely done.</td>', 'LOL at the title ;-)  Calm pigeon in the busy whirlwind of city life.  nicely done.', '2009-01-13 10:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
