(5188991, 755071, 88247, '<td valign="top">Nice one!! Coo,Coo;-)XX<br/> <br/>Guess I was spot on!!<br/> <br/>Great capture of the expression on the pigeons face.<br/>You couldn''t have picked a better title:-)<br/>I''m sure Deb will love this one!!</td>', 'Nice one!! Coo,Coo;-)XX Guess I was spot on!! Great capture of the expression on the pigeons face.You couldn''t have picked a better title:-)I''m sure Deb will love this one!!', '2009-01-13 10:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
