(5189329, 755066, 75192, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful abstract. Absolutely gorgeous, vibrant colours. It had a dreamlike-space effect. Loves the ''stars'' too.</td>', 'This is a beautiful abstract. Absolutely gorgeous, vibrant colours. It had a dreamlike-space effect. Loves the ''stars'' too.', '2009-01-13 15:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189335, 755260, 75192, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea and has the makings of a great shot. I don''t think the reflection adds anything to the shot, the coconuts ''hairs'' are distracting and the saturation is slightly too much. You should be proud of this though, because it''s obvious that effort and time was made.</td>', 'This is a good idea and has the makings of a great shot. I don''t think the reflection adds anything to the shot, the coconuts ''hairs'' are distracting and the saturation is slightly too much. You should be proud of this though, because it''s obvious that effort and time was made.', '2009-01-13 16:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189337, 754283, 75192, '<td valign="top">This is a very handsome bird. The lighting in the shot and the focus is off though. Nice crop.</td>', 'This is a very handsome bird. The lighting in the shot and the focus is off though. Nice crop.', '2009-01-13 16:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189338, 754650, 75192, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting and original take on the challenge. There''s quite a bit of noise and grain in the shot though. You did well with this idea.</td>', 'This is an interesting and original take on the challenge. There''s quite a bit of noise and grain in the shot though. You did well with this idea.', '2009-01-13 16:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189339, 755190, 75192, '<td valign="top">Some beautiful bokeh here and a nice head shot of the bird. It doesn''t seem crisp or sharp enough though... I think the focus got caught on the beak and eye - which I suppose is not a majorly bad thing - they''re major points of contact.</td>', 'Some beautiful bokeh here and a nice head shot of the bird. It doesn''t seem crisp or sharp enough though... I think the focus got caught on the beak and eye - which I suppose is not a majorly bad thing - they''re major points of contact.', '2009-01-13 16:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189341, 754988, 75192, '<td valign="top">This a a great shot, but I think his feet are too close to the frame and it''s slightly over-saturated.</td>', 'This a a great shot, but I think his feet are too close to the frame and it''s slightly over-saturated.', '2009-01-13 16:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189343, 755357, 75192, '<td valign="top">A nice picture, I like the colours. A bit more of a close up would have probably scored higher though.</td>', 'A nice picture, I like the colours. A bit more of a close up would have probably scored higher though.', '2009-01-13 16:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189347, 755376, 75192, '<td valign="top">This is a creative take on the challenge, so well done you. I don''t think the lighting is quite right though, and the different tone at the top of the frame is quite distracting to the overall shot. However, the flower is in shot and nicely coloured.</td>', 'This is a creative take on the challenge, so well done you. I don''t think the lighting is quite right though, and the different tone at the top of the frame is quite distracting to the overall shot. However, the flower is in shot and nicely coloured.', '2009-01-13 16:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189350, 755308, 75192, '<td valign="top">This was a good idea, but I think the flowers should have been the main point of focus and not the stones. Nice simple picture though. Very feng shui.</td>', 'This was a good idea, but I think the flowers should have been the main point of focus and not the stones. Nice simple picture though. Very feng shui.', '2009-01-13 16:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189356, 754475, 75192, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous creature and engaging stare, I do feel that this is too soft a portrait though. I think the softness should have got sharper towards the centre of his face/eyes.</td>', 'Gorgeous creature and engaging stare, I do feel that this is too soft a portrait though. I think the softness should have got sharper towards the centre of his face/eyes.', '2009-01-13 16:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189379, 754915, 75192, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Black and white was a good choice too. It seems a bit too noisy though and in need of slight straightening.</td>', 'Good idea. Black and white was a good choice too. It seems a bit too noisy though and in need of slight straightening.', '2009-01-13 16:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189381, 755360, 75192, '<td valign="top">Cute gals, nice poses, a genuine warmth between them. I don''t feel like this has the polished effect that it should have, but it''s a good effort.</td>', 'Cute gals, nice poses, a genuine warmth between them. I don''t feel like this has the polished effect that it should have, but it''s a good effort.', '2009-01-13 16:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189385, 754892, 75192, '<td valign="top">Nice tones in the water and a vibrant set of colours. A good angle and the border works well. May I be so bold to mention the fact that the model has a slight wedgie though?! Sorry, hope you''re not offended by that!</td>', 'Nice tones in the water and a vibrant set of colours. A good angle and the border works well. May I be so bold to mention the fact that the model has a slight wedgie though?! Sorry, hope you''re not offended by that!', '2009-01-13 16:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189388, 754868, 75192, '<td valign="top">A nice take on the challenge and some great tones &amp; shadows. The model seems slightly uncomfortable though and I don''t understand the title in terms of its relation to the picture.</td>', 'A nice take on the challenge and some great tones & shadows. The model seems slightly uncomfortable though and I don''t understand the title in terms of its relation to the picture.', '2009-01-13 16:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189391, 754739, 75192, '<td valign="top">A great shot because it''s fast action. The kid seems to be genuinely enjoying herself which is cute. <br/> <br/>Her skin tones have too much saturation which spoils the picture somewhat - I think a slight de-sat would have been put to good use overall.</td>', 'A great shot because it''s fast action. The kid seems to be genuinely enjoying herself which is cute.  Her skin tones have too much saturation which spoils the picture somewhat - I think a slight de-sat would have been put to good use overall.', '2009-01-13 16:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189392, 753822, 75192, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white aspect of this photo. I don''t really dig the focus on the hands though.... her face is the interesting bit, especially her vivid expression. More focus on the face would have been better imo.</td>', 'I like the black and white aspect of this photo. I don''t really dig the focus on the hands though.... her face is the interesting bit, especially her vivid expression. More focus on the face would have been better imo.', '2009-01-13 16:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189394, 754290, 75192, '<td valign="top">An interesting abstract and nice lines.</td>', 'An interesting abstract and nice lines.', '2009-01-13 16:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189396, 755397, 75192, '<td valign="top">Quite sweet, some good bokeh, but the focus seems slightly weak. The border works well.</td>', 'Quite sweet, some good bokeh, but the focus seems slightly weak. The border works well.', '2009-01-13 16:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189399, 755165, 75192, '<td valign="top">A good macro.... ants are very interesting insects. We don''t see many ant macros on here so it''s a nice change to a bee, butterfly or a stick insect! <br/> <br/>I think this might have been better in black and white because the colours are quite bland, and more focus on the object its moving too.</td>', 'A good macro.... ants are very interesting insects. We don''t see many ant macros on here so it''s a nice change to a bee, butterfly or a stick insect!  I think this might have been better in black and white because the colours are quite bland, and more focus on the object its moving too.', '2009-01-13 16:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189401, 755325, 75192, '<td valign="top">A nice picture, but I would have been tempted to get in closer and focus more on the shadows than the surroundings.</td>', 'A nice picture, but I would have been tempted to get in closer and focus more on the shadows than the surroundings.', '2009-01-13 16:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189402, 755242, 75192, '<td valign="top">A beautiful baby and nice skin tones. It does seem slightly out of focus though (or too much soft focus).</td>', 'A beautiful baby and nice skin tones. It does seem slightly out of focus though (or too much soft focus).', '2009-01-13 16:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189403, 754661, 75192, '<td valign="top">This is a good capture and some great expressions there! I like the sepia effect, but I feel that the colours are somewhat weak.... maybe a bit more contrast and a boost in saturation would have been beneficial to the shot.</td>', 'This is a good capture and some great expressions there! I like the sepia effect, but I feel that the colours are somewhat weak.... maybe a bit more contrast and a boost in saturation would have been beneficial to the shot.', '2009-01-13 16:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189407, 754771, 75192, '<td valign="top">A cute, natural picture.... they genuinely look as if they''re enjoying themselves! A good use of negative space..... although I would have saturated the sea to put a bit more colour in there though.</td>', 'A cute, natural picture.... they genuinely look as if they''re enjoying themselves! A good use of negative space..... although I would have saturated the sea to put a bit more colour in there though.', '2009-01-13 16:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189408, 755067, 75192, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot. Good focus on the eye and some nice tones... I do however feel that the focus and blur on the mouth is too distracting though. I would have cropped just above the eyebrows too.</td>', 'This is a lovely shot. Good focus on the eye and some nice tones... I do however feel that the focus and blur on the mouth is too distracting though. I would have cropped just above the eyebrows too.', '2009-01-13 16:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189409, 755077, 75192, '<td valign="top">Quite pretty, nice bokeh, but the area of focus is put out by the foreground leaf which is blurred. It''s a good effort though.</td>', 'Quite pretty, nice bokeh, but the area of focus is put out by the foreground leaf which is blurred. It''s a good effort though.', '2009-01-13 16:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189410, 754543, 76598, '<td valign="top">I would prefer that the near eye was in focus.</td>', 'I would prefer that the near eye was in focus.', '2009-01-13 16:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5189411, 754838, 75192, '<td valign="top">I love the silhouette and the nice sunset-y tones. I feel more contrast and a bit of a de-sat would have benefited though. Also, the cuff on her right leg/ankle is distracting to her overall form.</td>', 'I love the silhouette and the nice sunset-y tones. I feel more contrast and a bit of a de-sat would have benefited though. Also, the cuff on her right leg/ankle is distracting to her overall form.', '2009-01-13 16:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
