(5190358, 754433, 65234, '<td valign="top">Insane amount of detail!!  The eyes look weirdly plastic, like he''s wearing protective cups over them.  Amazing what things can look like up close.</td>', 'Insane amount of detail!!  The eyes look weirdly plastic, like he''s wearing protective cups over them.  Amazing what things can look like up close.', '2009-01-14 07:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
