(5191935, 753615, 50695, '<td valign="top">it looks so random at first, but the more you look at it, the perfection of it just grows and grows... everyone looking in the same direction... perfect symmetry, a shadow on one side &amp; reflected light on the other... the dog in his moment of evacuation... the man whose head was a pillar...<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'it looks so random at first, but the more you look at it, the perfection of it just grows and grows... everyone looking in the same direction... perfect symmetry, a shadow on one side & reflected light on the other... the dog in his moment of evacuation... the man whose head was a pillar... Posthumous Red Ribbon. ', '2009-01-14 22:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5191938, 755226, 50695, '<td valign="top">I hesitated to give this a ribbon because it''s almost TOO me, but I can''t help myself. There are stories here waiting to be told. There is the oppression of lens flare. There are all those possible paths in all those hopeless directions. There are those people spread out so oddly, like a cold constellation.<br/> <br/>I give you my Posthumous Yellow Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'I hesitated to give this a ribbon because it''s almost TOO me, but I can''t help myself. There are stories here waiting to be told. There is the oppression of lens flare. There are all those possible paths in all those hopeless directions. There are those people spread out so oddly, like a cold constellation. I give you my Posthumous Yellow Ribbon ', '2009-01-14 22:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
