(5193838, 755031, 75034, '<td valign="top">Hi Judi and Kita, Judi she will soon be taller then you. Beautiful shot.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Hi Judi and Kita, Judi she will soon be taller then you. Beautiful shot. MAX!', '2009-01-15 23:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194282, 754741, 46918, '<td valign="top">I love the pic!!!!!</td>', 'I love the pic!!!!!', '2009-01-16 02:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194419, 754633, 6999, '<td valign="top">Somehow seems to be not quite in focus: perhaps just lacking a degree of sharpness. I quite like the amount of negative space, and the refusal to include all the apples in frame; down-side is the slightly blue tinge to the background, which feels a little sickly to my eye.</td>', 'Somehow seems to be not quite in focus: perhaps just lacking a degree of sharpness. I quite like the amount of negative space, and the refusal to include all the apples in frame; down-side is the slightly blue tinge to the background, which feels a little sickly to my eye.', '2009-01-16 06:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194421, 753615, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, and the dog just the finishing touch.</td>', 'Wonderful, and the dog just the finishing touch.', '2009-01-16 06:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194422, 754650, 6999, '<td valign="top">A parade of ghosts; I enjoy the roughness of this, though perhaps the slightly off-square framing adds a dynamic that isn''t in the end helpful? And of course, I think ot cries out to be black and white - I don''t think the dirt and sootiness of it would be lost, and the parade of shapes might be enhanced. Fine work.</td>', 'A parade of ghosts; I enjoy the roughness of this, though perhaps the slightly off-square framing adds a dynamic that isn''t in the end helpful? And of course, I think ot cries out to be black and white - I don''t think the dirt and sootiness of it would be lost, and the parade of shapes might be enhanced. Fine work.', '2009-01-16 06:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194427, 754522, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fun to be verging on the quality of absolute chaos: I''m curious to know how muich further one could go before losing all sense of real-world reference in an image such as this. Great fun. Have to say I hate the border trick, however - seems completely naff compared with the riot of the image.</td>', 'Fun to be verging on the quality of absolute chaos: I''m curious to know how muich further one could go before losing all sense of real-world reference in an image such as this. Great fun. Have to say I hate the border trick, however - seems completely naff compared with the riot of the image.', '2009-01-16 06:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194438, 755226, 6999, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Strangely unbalanced; I''m unconvinced, really. I mean, hell, it''s more interesting than the vast majority, but I sense I''m dealing with a stronger eye and vision that deserves a tougher assessment. Somehow, not quite strange enough? Though one has to love the nearest figure, of course.</td>', 'Hmmm. Strangely unbalanced; I''m unconvinced, really. I mean, hell, it''s more interesting than the vast majority, but I sense I''m dealing with a stronger eye and vision that deserves a tougher assessment. Somehow, not quite strange enough? Though one has to love the nearest figure, of course.', '2009-01-16 06:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194792, 755251, 62187, '<td valign="top">The focus to me looks very good but I think it might have looked better in color - perhaps?</td>', 'The focus to me looks very good but I think it might have looked better in color - perhaps?', '2009-01-16 09:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194806, 755376, 62187, '<td valign="top">The photo has a very elegant look to it. To me, the only slight distraction is a bright spot on the end of the branch. Plus, it looks like some sensor dust just to the right of it: 8</td>', 'The photo has a very elegant look to it. To me, the only slight distraction is a bright spot on the end of the branch. Plus, it looks like some sensor dust just to the right of it: 8', '2009-01-16 09:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194813, 754978, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and edit: 8</td>', 'Nice capture and edit: 8', '2009-01-16 09:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194826, 755347, 62187, '<td valign="top">Those ''Hoodies'' always remind me of people who are or think they are gangsters. Anyway, the photo is very good, I like the blurred effect and drab colors: 10</td>', 'Those ''Hoodies'' always remind me of people who are or think they are gangsters. Anyway, the photo is very good, I like the blurred effect and drab colors: 10', '2009-01-16 09:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194832, 754902, 62187, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of some of the Cirque du soleil posters I see around town.</td>', 'Reminds me of some of the Cirque du soleil posters I see around town.', '2009-01-16 09:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194848, 755250, 100727, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful.  Is this real?  Where is this place?  The contrast is lovely.  The lines.  Just simply nicely executed (the exposure).</td>', 'This is really beautiful.  Is this real?  Where is this place?  The contrast is lovely.  The lines.  Just simply nicely executed (the exposure).', '2009-01-16 09:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194856, 755169, 100727, '<td valign="top">I love the clouds, especially the one on the left side.  It''s like coming down on them.  The sky colour is nice too.  Where is this place?</td>', 'I love the clouds, especially the one on the left side.  It''s like coming down on them.  The sky colour is nice too.  Where is this place?', '2009-01-16 09:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194870, 755345, 100727, '<td valign="top">Is the sky real or what?  It looks amazing.  Nice colours, overall.  Good luck!</td>', 'Is the sky real or what?  It looks amazing.  Nice colours, overall.  Good luck!', '2009-01-16 09:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194875, 754902, 100727, '<td valign="top">I love the tone and the facial expression.</td>', 'I love the tone and the facial expression.', '2009-01-16 09:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194882, 753915, 100727, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  I wonder what is it aiming at and wonder further whether it jumps at the thing or not.  Very nice.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  I wonder what is it aiming at and wonder further whether it jumps at the thing or not.  Very nice.', '2009-01-16 09:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194890, 754478, 100727, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I love the eye.  Nice tone overall.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I love the eye.  Nice tone overall.', '2009-01-16 09:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194894, 755325, 100727, '<td valign="top">This photo has lots of mysteries going on.  It''s really nice.  I wonder ... is it a cult meeting or what?  Haha.  Nice photo!</td>', 'This photo has lots of mysteries going on.  It''s really nice.  I wonder ... is it a cult meeting or what?  Haha.  Nice photo!', '2009-01-16 09:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194968, 755199, 102709, '<td valign="top">Beautiful moment you captured there.</td>', 'Beautiful moment you captured there.', '2009-01-16 09:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5195010, 755333, 100727, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.</td>', 'Very nice capture.', '2009-01-16 09:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5195041, 754978, 100727, '<td valign="top">This is so nice!  The tone, the contrast, the wave, everything.</td>', 'This is so nice!  The tone, the contrast, the wave, everything.', '2009-01-16 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5195050, 754978, 100066, '<td valign="top">The seafoam, the magical light on the rocks and the sea, the waiting man with a perfect high POV make the composition splendid.<br/>Congrats ,<br/>Zeynep</td>', 'The seafoam, the magical light on the rocks and the sea, the waiting man with a perfect high POV make the composition splendid.Congrats ,Zeynep', '2009-01-16 10:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5195086, 755158, 100727, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful tone.</td>', 'Very beautiful tone.', '2009-01-16 10:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5195093, 754341, 100727, '<td valign="top">Very unusual.  Nice.  It looks like they''re hugging each other, but that wing belongs to another bird, is it?</td>', 'Very unusual.  Nice.  It looks like they''re hugging each other, but that wing belongs to another bird, is it?', '2009-01-16 10:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5195132, 755396, 34192, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the editing enhances the image.</td>', 'I don''t think the editing enhances the image.', '2009-01-16 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5195153, 755016, 34192, '<td valign="top">Good composition and tones. Excellent timing to capture the subject.  I think your equipment held you back here - either not enough reach or not enough resolution to survive the crop required.  In this case, I would say its not the photographer its the equipment.</td>', 'Good composition and tones. Excellent timing to capture the subject.  I think your equipment held you back here - either not enough reach or not enough resolution to survive the crop required.  In this case, I would say its not the photographer its the equipment.', '2009-01-16 10:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5195160, 755362, 34192, '<td valign="top">Good composition and toning.  I think you over cropped though - your equipment is not up to the task.  I think you did well with what you had to work with, creating a painterly styled image to overcome the lack of resolution or focal length.</td>', 'Good composition and toning.  I think you over cropped though - your equipment is not up to the task.  I think you did well with what you had to work with, creating a painterly styled image to overcome the lack of resolution or focal length.', '2009-01-16 10:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5195162, 754522, 34192, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the blurred border - it competes with the image itself.  The high-key treatment works and doesn''t work for me - the bottom half is cool, the top half a little too convoluted to work for me.</td>', 'I don''t care for the blurred border - it competes with the image itself.  The high-key treatment works and doesn''t work for me - the bottom half is cool, the top half a little too convoluted to work for me.', '2009-01-16 10:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5195164, 753773, 34192, '<td valign="top">Great bokeh. Good composition.  This image is lacking in contrast for the majority of the image, which I think hurts it a little.</td>', 'Great bokeh. Good composition.  This image is lacking in contrast for the majority of the image, which I think hurts it a little.', '2009-01-16 10:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5195170, 755324, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think you composed well for the subject but the subject itself lacks punch.</td>', 'I think you composed well for the subject but the subject itself lacks punch.', '2009-01-16 10:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5195195, 755342, 34192, '<td valign="top">Well hued. Not a lot of interest except as a subject study.  Could be a little sharper.</td>', 'Well hued. Not a lot of interest except as a subject study.  Could be a little sharper.', '2009-01-16 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5195396, 755288, 73235, '<td valign="top">there is a lot of details in your picture. on the other side there is nothing really exciting in it to keep the viewer exploring</td>', 'there is a lot of details in your picture. on the other side there is nothing really exciting in it to keep the viewer exploring', '2009-01-16 12:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5195400, 754475, 77192, '<td valign="top">Amazing! I''m a bit puzzled by his eyes though, I sort of feel his pupils should be larger</td>', 'Amazing! I''m a bit puzzled by his eyes though, I sort of feel his pupils should be larger', '2009-01-16 12:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
