(5196184, 755364, 62187, '<td valign="top">Whenever I see a photo of Elephants, I think of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=24454" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Sandyp</a>. The always remind me of this photo: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=545779" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/692/120/545779.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/692/120/545779.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/692/120/545779.jpg"/></a> <br/>I like this photo, the conversion is perfect. I think your photo will score very high in this challenge.</td>', 'Whenever I see a photo of Elephants, I think of  Sandyp. The always remind me of this photo:  I like this photo, the conversion is perfect. I think your photo will score very high in this challenge.', '2009-01-16 16:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196192, 754941, 62187, '<td valign="top">An awesome photo, I''m sure it will go over big-time and the voters should eat this up heels over head! Bumping from 9 to 10</td>', 'An awesome photo, I''m sure it will go over big-time and the voters should eat this up heels over head! Bumping from 9 to 10', '2009-01-16 16:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196226, 755296, 62187, '<td valign="top">I had to look it up:<br/> <br/>Ingredients:<br/>a bottle of red wine <br/>handful of whole cloves<br/>handful of whole star anise<br/>sections of one orange<br/>about 2tsp ground cinnamon<br/>about 1 tsp nutmeg<br/> <br/>Not something that I think would appeal to me, but, it''s a very nice photo. It has that ''HDR'' look or whatever that is but not quite. So, to me, it still holds a photographic look instead of looking like a cartoon. Very nice and I hope it does well: 9</td>', 'I had to look it up: Ingredients:a bottle of red wine handful of whole cloveshandful of whole star anisesections of one orangeabout 2tsp ground cinnamonabout 1 tsp nutmeg Not something that I think would appeal to me, but, it''s a very nice photo. It has that ''HDR'' look or whatever that is but not quite. So, to me, it still holds a photographic look instead of looking like a cartoon. Very nice and I hope it does well: 9', '2009-01-16 16:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196241, 754915, 62187, '<td valign="top">A very interesting looking place to me and a perfectly composed photograph. It almost makes me think it''s someplace that evil things happened in a long time ago. Bumping from 9 to 10</td>', 'A very interesting looking place to me and a perfectly composed photograph. It almost makes me think it''s someplace that evil things happened in a long time ago. Bumping from 9 to 10', '2009-01-16 16:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196249, 755015, 62187, '<td valign="top">The photo has very little appeal to me but it''s an excellent photo: 9</td>', 'The photo has very little appeal to me but it''s an excellent photo: 9', '2009-01-16 16:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196254, 755356, 62187, '<td valign="top">What a super cute pooch. To me, the colors are a little bizarre and not natural. I''m still going high with a 9</td>', 'What a super cute pooch. To me, the colors are a little bizarre and not natural. I''m still going high with a 9', '2009-01-16 16:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196264, 755072, 62187, '<td valign="top">It always bugs me when people in the crosswalk stand close to the street. Just like this guy is to the river. Why do they do that? Anyway, The photo is great but the edit, to me, gives it a non-photographic look to it. More like a painting. I''m still going fairly high with an 8.</td>', 'It always bugs me when people in the crosswalk stand close to the street. Just like this guy is to the river. Why do they do that? Anyway, The photo is great but the edit, to me, gives it a non-photographic look to it. More like a painting. I''m still going fairly high with an 8.', '2009-01-16 16:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196268, 755222, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very cute, I think the voters will eat it up. Not quite my type of photo but it''s very good. I think the focus could be slightly crisper but the conversion and crop are excellent. 8</td>', 'Very cute, I think the voters will eat it up. Not quite my type of photo but it''s very good. I think the focus could be slightly crisper but the conversion and crop are excellent. 8', '2009-01-16 16:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196290, 754701, 62187, '<td valign="top">If ''Life'' is ''not a box of chocolates'' then, I should always know what I''ll get? Is that it? Anyway, I like the blueish tint rather then totally black and white. The paintings on the wall and off-centered table make up for the centered man (centered subjects always kind of bug me). The quality of the photo is very good and all in all the photo has a very strange emotive feel. I think it will do well: 8</td>', 'If ''Life'' is ''not a box of chocolates'' then, I should always know what I''ll get? Is that it? Anyway, I like the blueish tint rather then totally black and white. The paintings on the wall and off-centered table make up for the centered man (centered subjects always kind of bug me). The quality of the photo is very good and all in all the photo has a very strange emotive feel. I think it will do well: 8', '2009-01-16 16:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196298, 755345, 62187, '<td valign="top">The photo is certainly a 10. But for me, ''People'' in natural settings such as this mostly take away from the beauty. I''ll go with a 9</td>', 'The photo is certainly a 10. But for me, ''People'' in natural settings such as this mostly take away from the beauty. I''ll go with a 9', '2009-01-16 16:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196304, 755378, 62187, '<td valign="top">For some reason this photo really appeals to me: 8</td>', 'For some reason this photo really appeals to me: 8', '2009-01-16 16:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196320, 754661, 62187, '<td valign="top">The photo is excellent and should go over very well for the challenge. I think the only thing that could improve the photo would have been (if possible) to have left more dead space on the left. What do I know? 8</td>', 'The photo is excellent and should go over very well for the challenge. I think the only thing that could improve the photo would have been (if possible) to have left more dead space on the left. What do I know? 8', '2009-01-16 16:35:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5196479, 755250, 62187, '<td valign="top">I love the starkness of your photo and I certainly think if fits the challenge: 8</td>', 'I love the starkness of your photo and I certainly think if fits the challenge: 8', '2009-01-16 17:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196497, 754570, 62187, '<td valign="top">Well, Flys are gross to me. But your photo is very excellent. I find it kind of pleasantly ironic that the subject of your ''Life'' photo survives by living off of decay. Well done!</td>', 'Well, Flys are gross to me. But your photo is very excellent. I find it kind of pleasantly ironic that the subject of your ''Life'' photo survives by living off of decay. Well done!', '2009-01-16 17:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196504, 755254, 62187, '<td valign="top">The different lines are excellent!</td>', 'The different lines are excellent!', '2009-01-16 17:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196542, 754051, 62187, '<td valign="top">Wow, a few centuries have sure changed him quite a bit!<br/> <br/><a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Ren%C3%A9_Descartes.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">René Descartes</a> <br/> <br/>An excellent photo that should do very well. I think you could have darkened the heck out of the cage lines and that might have made it even better if possible. Nice work! 9</td>', 'Wow, a few centuries have sure changed him quite a bit! René Descartes  An excellent photo that should do very well. I think you could have darkened the heck out of the cage lines and that might have made it even better if possible. Nice work! 9', '2009-01-16 17:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196551, 754058, 62187, '<td valign="top">It almost looks like a stuffed toy. It''s perfect except the the whiskers which seem jagged. I''m sure a larger sized photo would not show it the same. What''s up with the ''Validation''? Seems perfectly legit to me.</td>', 'It almost looks like a stuffed toy. It''s perfect except the the whiskers which seem jagged. I''m sure a larger sized photo would not show it the same. What''s up with the ''Validation''? Seems perfectly legit to me.', '2009-01-16 17:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196565, 754960, 62187, '<td valign="top">The photo reminds me of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27133" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Judi</a>''s style although I don''t think it snows where she lives. I like it and I think it will do very well: 8</td>', 'The photo reminds me of  Judi''s style although I don''t think it snows where she lives. I like it and I think it will do very well: 8', '2009-01-16 17:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196588, 754772, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s an absolutely adorable pupper. I love it and I''m bumping it up from an 8 to a 10.</td>', 'It''s an absolutely adorable pupper. I love it and I''m bumping it up from an 8 to a 10.', '2009-01-16 17:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196615, 754250, 62187, '<td valign="top">Neat! But what''s my porch light doing on the ground? 8</td>', 'Neat! But what''s my porch light doing on the ground? 8', '2009-01-16 17:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196616, 755231, 62187, '<td valign="top">Not really to hip on the whole photo but I do find it better then average photographically. What I am intrigued about is the border: I don''t think I''ve ever seen something like that used at DPC before.</td>', 'Not really to hip on the whole photo but I do find it better then average photographically. What I am intrigued about is the border: I don''t think I''ve ever seen something like that used at DPC before.', '2009-01-16 17:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196636, 755139, 62187, '<td valign="top">Isn''t this a Pink Floyd album cover? I like the high contrast.</td>', 'Isn''t this a Pink Floyd album cover? I like the high contrast.', '2009-01-16 17:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196638, 755296, 61396, '<td valign="top">I can''t stop looking at this community gathering for several minutes now. There are so many details (from the pair of boots at the lower left, to the man with the dog at the center, the trails in the snow and the people wandering at the edge of the group, and so much more). I also like how the image is composed with multiple layers of colors, (yellow hay, white snow, brown trees and gray skies) with all the people in between. Lovely!</td>', 'I can''t stop looking at this community gathering for several minutes now. There are so many details (from the pair of boots at the lower left, to the man with the dog at the center, the trails in the snow and the people wandering at the edge of the group, and so much more). I also like how the image is composed with multiple layers of colors, (yellow hay, white snow, brown trees and gray skies) with all the people in between. Lovely!', '2009-01-16 17:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196640, 755400, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice focus - unless you did that in photoshop!?!?!?! A super cute puppy!</td>', 'Nice focus - unless you did that in photoshop!?!?!?! A super cute puppy!', '2009-01-16 17:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196644, 755335, 62187, '<td valign="top">The blurred background give it a feel that the flower is cruising along pretty fast: nice!</td>', 'The blurred background give it a feel that the flower is cruising along pretty fast: nice!', '2009-01-16 17:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196649, 754284, 62187, '<td valign="top">The colors to me are a little garish but the focus is right on! 9</td>', 'The colors to me are a little garish but the focus is right on! 9', '2009-01-16 17:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196653, 753352, 62187, '<td valign="top">The focus on Mildred''s face is really, really good. However, her nose and ears look too smooth - to me. Like you''ve used too much NeatImage or another noise reduction program. Maybe not? It''s a cute puppy for sure.</td>', 'The focus on Mildred''s face is really, really good. However, her nose and ears look too smooth - to me. Like you''ve used too much NeatImage or another noise reduction program. Maybe not? It''s a cute puppy for sure.', '2009-01-16 17:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196663, 755301, 62187, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the recent work by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=80096" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">digifotojo</a>. It''s a very nice exposure but I think the photo might have been improved with a slightly wider view (if possible).</td>', 'This reminds me of the recent work by  digifotojo. It''s a very nice exposure but I think the photo might have been improved with a slightly wider view (if possible).', '2009-01-16 17:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196672, 755317, 62187, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty funny!</td>', 'That''s pretty funny!', '2009-01-16 17:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196683, 755272, 62187, '<td valign="top">Not really my kind of photo but I''ll bet it will do very, very well. I think DPC''ers really like this kind of stuff.<br/> <br/><a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joie_de_vivre" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Joie de Vivre - Wikipedia</a></td>', 'Not really my kind of photo but I''ll bet it will do very, very well. I think DPC''ers really like this kind of stuff. Joie de Vivre - Wikipedia', '2009-01-16 17:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196686, 755251, 61961, '<td valign="top">Well done!  Probably would succeed in the Ansel Adams II challenge, too.</td>', 'Well done!  Probably would succeed in the Ansel Adams II challenge, too.', '2009-01-16 17:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196700, 755077, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very simple and nicely presented!</td>', 'Very simple and nicely presented!', '2009-01-16 17:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196731, 754147, 62187, '<td valign="top">Looks like that ''HDR'' or whatever that is, but converted to B&amp;W: different. The drink cup and cup holder kinda take away from the shot I think. Overall, I still like it.</td>', 'Looks like that ''HDR'' or whatever that is, but converted to B&W: different. The drink cup and cup holder kinda take away from the shot I think. Overall, I still like it.', '2009-01-16 17:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196736, 755298, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and three dimensional looking: 8</td>', 'Very crisp and three dimensional looking: 8', '2009-01-16 17:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196739, 755135, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t really know what to say. I like it in some ways but for the most part it is just too busy for me.</td>', 'I don''t really know what to say. I like it in some ways but for the most part it is just too busy for me.', '2009-01-16 17:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196745, 755352, 61961, '<td valign="top">This is so cute it hurts.  What a beautiful baby.  Love the soft light and gorgeous skin tones, and the subtle DOF.  Great overall clarity without being over-sharp.</td>', 'This is so cute it hurts.  What a beautiful baby.  Love the soft light and gorgeous skin tones, and the subtle DOF.  Great overall clarity without being over-sharp.', '2009-01-16 17:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196746, 754363, 62187, '<td valign="top">Showing the ground might have made it even more interesting. So we could see exactly how high he was. As is, it still looks high and I would never do that. Well, maybe on accident!</td>', 'Showing the ground might have made it even more interesting. So we could see exactly how high he was. As is, it still looks high and I would never do that. Well, maybe on accident!', '2009-01-16 17:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196763, 755263, 76617, '<td valign="top">At first glance I felt the it was to heavy of a composition, but the direction of the babies eyes creates a line perspective line to the left. I really like this piece. I enjoy the contrast between the light of innocence and simplistic contrast of the ominous black background seeping from the right but not overpowering.</td>', 'At first glance I felt the it was to heavy of a composition, but the direction of the babies eyes creates a line perspective line to the left. I really like this piece. I enjoy the contrast between the light of innocence and simplistic contrast of the ominous black background seeping from the right but not overpowering.', '2009-01-16 18:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196794, 754866, 76617, '<td valign="top">A shot this perfect belongs in the national geographic. Bravo! Technically perfectm, fabulous composition and depth of field and the focus on the face particularly the eyes couldn''t get any better. Superior wildlife shot!</td>', 'A shot this perfect belongs in the national geographic. Bravo! Technically perfectm, fabulous composition and depth of field and the focus on the face particularly the eyes couldn''t get any better. Superior wildlife shot!', '2009-01-16 18:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196810, 755356, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very cute dog.  Excellent expression.  I go back and forth on the processing, not sure if it hurts or helps.  But, I like the image as it is, so it can''t hurt. 8</td>', 'Very cute dog.  Excellent expression.  I go back and forth on the processing, not sure if it hurts or helps.  But, I like the image as it is, so it can''t hurt. 8', '2009-01-16 18:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196837, 755285, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great facial expression.</td>', 'Great facial expression.', '2009-01-16 18:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196965, 755158, 62187, '<td valign="top">One of those weird photos to me that are soft but completely in total focus. My initial vote was a 6 but am bumping to a 9.</td>', 'One of those weird photos to me that are soft but completely in total focus. My initial vote was a 6 but am bumping to a 9.', '2009-01-16 18:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196976, 755240, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s a great idea. Parts of the hands and the edges of the plant look, but I know they''re not, cut and paste. More so, there is some dust spots along the bottom of the photo that I think could have been legally ''burned'' out.</td>', 'It''s a great idea. Parts of the hands and the edges of the plant look, but I know they''re not, cut and paste. More so, there is some dust spots along the bottom of the photo that I think could have been legally ''burned'' out.', '2009-01-16 18:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196983, 753915, 62187, '<td valign="top">He certainly looks like something interesting has gotten his attention. The crop is perfect.</td>', 'He certainly looks like something interesting has gotten his attention. The crop is perfect.', '2009-01-16 18:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196991, 754290, 62187, '<td valign="top">I have no idea why but it''s a very creative shot. The focus is perfect as well and the contrasting colors. That shadow is right on! Bumping from 6 to 8</td>', 'I have no idea why but it''s a very creative shot. The focus is perfect as well and the contrasting colors. That shadow is right on! Bumping from 6 to 8', '2009-01-16 18:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196995, 755325, 62187, '<td valign="top">That was a great movie and with that suggestion, this photo is really creepy!</td>', 'That was a great movie and with that suggestion, this photo is really creepy!', '2009-01-16 18:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5196996, 754650, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s almost like that ''Close Encounters'' entry - but closer. I like this one too!</td>', 'It''s almost like that ''Close Encounters'' entry - but closer. I like this one too!', '2009-01-16 18:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5197002, 754924, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s a good thing her right arm is not going up - then she would be in the shape of a nazi swastika! Anyway, she certainly is ''Alive'' and the photographic quality is perfect. Not one of my favorites but I can''t vote it anything less then 10.</td>', 'It''s a good thing her right arm is not going up - then she would be in the shape of a nazi swastika! Anyway, she certainly is ''Alive'' and the photographic quality is perfect. Not one of my favorites but I can''t vote it anything less then 10.', '2009-01-16 18:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5197004, 754771, 62187, '<td valign="top">It didn''t appeal to me at first but I''m now back and I find it photographically very good. The water looks a little ''faded'' for lack of better word. Bumping from a 6 to a 9</td>', 'It didn''t appeal to me at first but I''m now back and I find it photographically very good. The water looks a little ''faded'' for lack of better word. Bumping from a 6 to a 9', '2009-01-16 18:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5197006, 755274, 62187, '<td valign="top">That seems really uncommon to me. Totally funny. (I hope it''s supposed to be funny)</td>', 'That seems really uncommon to me. Totally funny. (I hope it''s supposed to be funny)', '2009-01-16 18:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5197057, 755067, 75034, '<td valign="top">Now this little one is no stranger to this site and has garnered his fare share of ribbons for his parents, but this time, if I had to guess as to which one I would go with Mom <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=55838" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">aimeethetoo</a> and I have to say that this is a fantastic shot as always.<br/> <br/>Best of luck :)<br/> <br/>MAX!<br/> <br/>Sorry about the mix up Tim I meant to put Aimee not Lydia. I hope this removes the confusion I caused in your home :)<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-19 08:47:42.</i></td>', 'Now this little one is no stranger to this site and has garnered his fare share of ribbons for his parents, but this time, if I had to guess as to which one I would go with Mom  aimeethetoo and I have to say that this is a fantastic shot as always. Best of luck :) MAX! Sorry about the mix up Tim I meant to put Aimee not Lydia. I hope this removes the confusion I caused in your home :)', '2009-01-16 19:21:23.000000', '2009-01-19 08:47:42.000000', 1),
