(5198160, 755169, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been much more dramatic if there were more color in the clouds, if that would have been possible. As is, I really like the low clouds hanging out in the sky - it''s a nice capture.</td>', 'I think it would have been much more dramatic if there were more color in the clouds, if that would have been possible. As is, I really like the low clouds hanging out in the sky - it''s a nice capture.', '2009-01-17 09:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
