(5198177, 754934, 62187, '<td valign="top">Is that that Olympic swimmer guy? Probably not but geez, it''s just a kid and he needs to chill out! j/k };&gt;)</td>', 'Is that that Olympic swimmer guy? Probably not but geez, it''s just a kid and he needs to chill out! j/k };>)', '2009-01-17 09:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
