(5198188, 755067, 62187, '<td valign="top">You are correct. Maybe that''s why I feel dead half the time. I know, I''ll go look at my entries score: that will make me laugh! The composition and the conversion look very nice as well as your focus.</td>', 'You are correct. Maybe that''s why I feel dead half the time. I know, I''ll go look at my entries score: that will make me laugh! The composition and the conversion look very nice as well as your focus.', '2009-01-17 09:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198189, 755401, 62187, '<td valign="top">Looks like you took some time to make an indoors photo look like outside. Some strangeness going on down in the roots though - to me.</td>', 'Looks like you took some time to make an indoors photo look like outside. Some strangeness going on down in the roots though - to me.', '2009-01-17 09:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198205, 755259, 62187, '<td valign="top">I had to look a couple of times. I thought the photo was trying to say that the little girl thought her costume was her life, future and everything. I get it now: it''s your daughter and she is your life, future and everything! Duh...what is wrong with me! Anyway, wow, do they make that costume in adult size? That would be hilarious! Your photo has very good focus and I like the contrast of the blues and browns.</td>', 'I had to look a couple of times. I thought the photo was trying to say that the little girl thought her costume was her life, future and everything. I get it now: it''s your daughter and she is your life, future and everything! Duh...what is wrong with me! Anyway, wow, do they make that costume in adult size? That would be hilarious! Your photo has very good focus and I like the contrast of the blues and browns.', '2009-01-17 09:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198207, 753595, 62187, '<td valign="top">I thought it was going to be wings. The shades of grey and white look nice.</td>', 'I thought it was going to be wings. The shades of grey and white look nice.', '2009-01-17 09:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198208, 755126, 62187, '<td valign="top">Fairly good desat job that really makes it look three dimensional.</td>', 'Fairly good desat job that really makes it look three dimensional.', '2009-01-17 09:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198210, 755066, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus, I think your photo has an artsy feel that will do well in this challenge.</td>', 'Very nice focus, I think your photo has an artsy feel that will do well in this challenge.', '2009-01-17 09:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198215, 754631, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think your photo has the best lighting of any photo in this challenge. The focus is perfect as well. Hmmm? I originally gave your photo a 6 because it doesn''t really do much for me. But, knowing that should not matter, I''ll have to bump it to a 9.</td>', 'I think your photo has the best lighting of any photo in this challenge. The focus is perfect as well. Hmmm? I originally gave your photo a 6 because it doesn''t really do much for me. But, knowing that should not matter, I''ll have to bump it to a 9.', '2009-01-17 09:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198217, 755226, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the ''beeing'' meaning. If I ignored the title would I see ''Life''. Hmmm? No, but it''s a nice photo and very emotive looking. For me, I''m getting a feeling of depression and I mean that in a good artistic way not literally.</td>', 'I don''t get the ''beeing'' meaning. If I ignored the title would I see ''Life''. Hmmm? No, but it''s a nice photo and very emotive looking. For me, I''m getting a feeling of depression and I mean that in a good artistic way not literally.', '2009-01-17 09:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198224, 755051, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s a very, very nice photo: focus, crop and composition. To me, the contrast is a little flat. It''s a very cute calf that I was originally scoring at 6. I think I''ll bump it to 8.</td>', 'It''s a very, very nice photo: focus, crop and composition. To me, the contrast is a little flat. It''s a very cute calf that I was originally scoring at 6. I think I''ll bump it to 8.', '2009-01-17 09:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
