(5198253, 754789, 62187, '<td valign="top">If you can''t think of a title why should I think of a score? I know - ''Unscored''! Just kidding. It''s a very sharp photo: maybe too sharp at the end of the curly thing.</td>', 'If you can''t think of a title why should I think of a score? I know - ''Unscored''! Just kidding. It''s a very sharp photo: maybe too sharp at the end of the curly thing.', '2009-01-17 09:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
