(5198260, 753422, 62187, '<td valign="top">The colors seems to have a low contrast look which I guess is neither good nor bad. I like the dirt flying in the air and it really gives it a nice 3D look.</td>', 'The colors seems to have a low contrast look which I guess is neither good nor bad. I like the dirt flying in the air and it really gives it a nice 3D look.', '2009-01-17 10:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
