(5198276, 755199, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get the title and for me makes it more confusing. Hmmm? Child with very red cheeks and crying? I wonder why. The eye color and focus is very nice.</td>', 'I don''t really get the title and for me makes it more confusing. Hmmm? Child with very red cheeks and crying? I wonder why. The eye color and focus is very nice.', '2009-01-17 10:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
