(5198292, 754661, 73250, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture.The compostion, focus, tones, shadows and textures all work so well. My only thought would be to take a little of the room off of the top...to focus the viewer more on the subject. Perfect for the theme.</td>', 'Wonderful capture.The compostion, focus, tones, shadows and textures all work so well. My only thought would be to take a little of the room off of the top...to focus the viewer more on the subject. Perfect for the theme.', '2009-01-17 10:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
