(5198302, 755169, 73250, '<td valign="top">One of my favs in this challenge...it''s people out living life!! Nicely composed and just very well done.</td>', 'One of my favs in this challenge...it''s people out living life!! Nicely composed and just very well done.', '2009-01-17 10:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198307, 755356, 73250, '<td valign="top">Love this...excellent textures and that face!! Well done.</td>', 'Love this...excellent textures and that face!! Well done.', '2009-01-17 10:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198310, 755340, 62187, '<td valign="top">Okay, when I originally saw the photo, I liked it. Then I read the title, and I hated it. For some reason it ticked me off. So much so, that I wanted to score it at 5. But, I know this site is about photography and not titles. So, I really like the blue/green contrast. The frosty blue background is very nice. Does it say ''Life''? Probably as much as many of the other photos. So, I''ll deal with my dislike for the title and go with an 8 instead. Okay?<br/> <br/>It would be nice to know why you chose to add the ''ACW(all comments welcome)'' to your title. Of course, all comments should be welcome: that''s what we do here right?</td>', 'Okay, when I originally saw the photo, I liked it. Then I read the title, and I hated it. For some reason it ticked me off. So much so, that I wanted to score it at 5. But, I know this site is about photography and not titles. So, I really like the blue/green contrast. The frosty blue background is very nice. Does it say ''Life''? Probably as much as many of the other photos. So, I''ll deal with my dislike for the title and go with an 8 instead. Okay? It would be nice to know why you chose to add the ''ACW(all comments welcome)'' to your title. Of course, all comments should be welcome: that''s what we do here right?', '2009-01-17 10:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198317, 755117, 62187, '<td valign="top">Is the title on purpose? If so, I guess it''s kind of creative. The photo has very good focus and I like the contrasting colors.</td>', 'Is the title on purpose? If so, I guess it''s kind of creative. The photo has very good focus and I like the contrasting colors.', '2009-01-17 10:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198318, 754825, 62187, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=727700" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/62187/120/727700.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/62187/120/727700.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/62187/120/727700.jpg"/></a></td>', '', '2009-01-17 10:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198325, 754275, 62187, '<td valign="top">That little guy looks like he''s really bookin'' along! Nice work behind the camera.</td>', 'That little guy looks like he''s really bookin'' along! Nice work behind the camera.', '2009-01-17 10:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198329, 754969, 62187, '<td valign="top">Good use of rule of thirds.</td>', 'Good use of rule of thirds.', '2009-01-17 10:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198335, 755198, 62187, '<td valign="top">The color in his face seems slightly washed-out but over-all the rest seems normal to me. Cute kid - are ya''ll done with the snow yet? It''s been nearly 70 degrees at my house. Stay warm!</td>', 'The color in his face seems slightly washed-out but over-all the rest seems normal to me. Cute kid - are ya''ll done with the snow yet? It''s been nearly 70 degrees at my house. Stay warm!', '2009-01-17 10:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198347, 754838, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''ve taken photos thru a piece of welders glass that remind me of this photo. It''s not really my kind of photo but I think the majority of DPC''ers will eat this up. The photo is almost ''rule of thirds'' which if it were perfect, I think would have improved it to perfect (for me): 8</td>', 'I''ve taken photos thru a piece of welders glass that remind me of this photo. It''s not really my kind of photo but I think the majority of DPC''ers will eat this up. The photo is almost ''rule of thirds'' which if it were perfect, I think would have improved it to perfect (for me): 8', '2009-01-17 10:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198350, 754845, 62187, '<td valign="top">Not bad at such a backlit subject.</td>', 'Not bad at such a backlit subject.', '2009-01-17 10:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198358, 755324, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think it''s an excellent photo but lacking in ''Life''. The focus is superb! Is this Jo? I already made a guess on another photo.</td>', 'I think it''s an excellent photo but lacking in ''Life''. The focus is superb! Is this Jo? I already made a guess on another photo.', '2009-01-17 10:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
