(5198414, 755271, 62187, '<td valign="top">It looks like an awesome place to live and a rewarding yet hard life. But, I wonder why you''ve chosen to crop out the top and left side of the barn?</td>', 'It looks like an awesome place to live and a rewarding yet hard life. But, I wonder why you''ve chosen to crop out the top and left side of the barn?', '2009-01-17 10:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198424, 755242, 62187, '<td valign="top">Looks as soft as a baby feels. For some reason, I''m getting some weird, barely visible purple and green hues through out the photo.</td>', 'Looks as soft as a baby feels. For some reason, I''m getting some weird, barely visible purple and green hues through out the photo.', '2009-01-17 10:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
