(5198701, 754801, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''ve never tried to take a photo like this but I''ll bet it''s harder then it looks. I''d give your photo a higher score if the focus were a little sharper. I really like those colors and as ugly as he is, he''s still kinda cute!</td>', 'I''ve never tried to take a photo like this but I''ll bet it''s harder then it looks. I''d give your photo a higher score if the focus were a little sharper. I really like those colors and as ugly as he is, he''s still kinda cute!', '2009-01-17 11:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198714, 754235, 62187, '<td valign="top">At first, I scored this photo at 5. Now, looking again, I see those deer (I think that''s what they are) and what I thought was unfocused is probably really snow and wind in the trees. So, on second glance, it''s very good and I like it a lot. Bumping to 8</td>', 'At first, I scored this photo at 5. Now, looking again, I see those deer (I think that''s what they are) and what I thought was unfocused is probably really snow and wind in the trees. So, on second glance, it''s very good and I like it a lot. Bumping to 8', '2009-01-17 11:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
