(5202815, 755400, 75532, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this<br/>One thing I wish his head were more... level.  The tilt seems to throw it off for me for some reason, maybe a pet peeve of mine, either way great job, great tones. 7</td>', 'Absolutely love thisOne thing I wish his head were more... level.  The tilt seems to throw it off for me for some reason, maybe a pet peeve of mine, either way great job, great tones. 7', '2009-01-18 19:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
