(5203647, 754570, 75034, '<td valign="top">Roz, Roz, Roz, as soon as I saw this shot I knew it was yours and I knew that this was the Blue ribbon winner. You are the Queen of insect photography.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on another fantastic image and your new PB.<br/> <br/>YOU ROCK ROZ<br/> <br/>PS: Watch out for <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=68413" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">GregoryB</a> he''s getting all smoochy and stuff "Congratulations honey on a brilliant image, a new PB and a well deserved blue ribbon.....xox" I think he''s looking over your shoulder and taking notes :)<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Roz, Roz, Roz, as soon as I saw this shot I knew it was yours and I knew that this was the Blue ribbon winner. You are the Queen of insect photography. Congratulations on another fantastic image and your new PB. YOU ROCK ROZ PS: Watch out for  GregoryB he''s getting all smoochy and stuff "Congratulations honey on a brilliant image, a new PB and a well deserved blue ribbon.....xox" I think he''s looking over your shoulder and taking notes :) MAX!', '2009-01-19 08:36:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203648, 754433, 35994, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot Greg!! Congrats on the ribbon &amp; new pb! I''m jealous of you &amp; <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=67145" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">roz</a>''s macros lately, they are awesome!!!</td>', 'Sweet shot Greg!! Congrats on the ribbon & new pb! I''m jealous of you &  roz''s macros lately, they are awesome!!!', '2009-01-19 08:37:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203649, 755226, 88523, '<td valign="top">The lens flare is great... I think it is very fitting of the challenge in that with four silhouettes you''re illustrating different stages of life we go through.</td>', 'The lens flare is great... I think it is very fitting of the challenge in that with four silhouettes you''re illustrating different stages of life we go through.', '2009-01-19 08:38:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203650, 755226, 33535, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> To me, the "typo" made the shot. Everyone else is exhibiting hive behavior except for the only human "beeing" who lived in harmony with the Universe, rather than with other bees. The hive-like hexagon of lens flare bokeh seals the deal. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Tehehe, awesome interpretation! :D<br/>thanks don!</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: To me, the "typo" made the shot. Everyone else is exhibiting hive behavior except for the only human "beeing" who lived in harmony with the Universe, rather than with other bees. The hive-like hexagon of lens flare bokeh seals the deal.   Tehehe, awesome interpretation! :Dthanks don!', '2009-01-19 08:39:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203651, 754570, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, Roz!  I knew yours and Greg''s photos belonged to the two of you.  Couldn''t tell which was whose, but I am ECSTATIC that you both won ribbons.  You have mentored well!  CONGRATULATIONS on continued confirmation that there is NO ONE like you at macro photography!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh, Roz!  I knew yours and Greg''s photos belonged to the two of you.  Couldn''t tell which was whose, but I am ECSTATIC that you both won ribbons.  You have mentored well!  CONGRATULATIONS on continued confirmation that there is NO ONE like you at macro photography! ', '2009-01-19 08:40:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203653, 754570, 2158, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a really fantastic shot.</td>', 'Congratulations on a really fantastic shot.', '2009-01-19 08:40:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203655, 754433, 24454, '<td valign="top">GREG!  Yayyyy!!!   I knew this one and Roz'' must belong to the two of you, but wasn''t sure whose was whose.   You are now officially at the top of the charts with your "better than the best" macro photography!  This photo is freaking AMAZING!  And YOU are THE BOMB!<br/> <br/><b>CONGRATULATIONS</b> on your first of MANY I''m sure ribbons and awards!<br/> <br/></td>', 'GREG!  Yayyyy!!!   I knew this one and Roz'' must belong to the two of you, but wasn''t sure whose was whose.   You are now officially at the top of the charts with your "better than the best" macro photography!  This photo is freaking AMAZING!  And YOU are THE BOMB! CONGRATULATIONS on your first of MANY I''m sure ribbons and awards! ', '2009-01-19 08:42:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203656, 754478, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh YES!  You don''t know how many times I have chased birds and geese hoping for something this fabulous!  This is National Geographic material!  Contratulations on a MOST deserving ribbon for this!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh YES!  You don''t know how many times I have chased birds and geese hoping for something this fabulous!  This is National Geographic material!  Contratulations on a MOST deserving ribbon for this! ', '2009-01-19 08:43:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203657, 753615, 88523, '<td valign="top">Great scene, I like the strong contrasts and balance.</td>', 'Great scene, I like the strong contrasts and balance.', '2009-01-19 08:43:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203659, 754772, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh Summer!  She is so beautiful.  And this is such a soulful photo of her.  5.98 tho ? :(  It is so sadly underrated!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ohhhh Summer!  She is so beautiful.  And this is such a soulful photo of her.  5.98 tho ? :(  It is so sadly underrated! ', '2009-01-19 08:46:01.000000', NULL, 0),
