(5203680, 755356, 58415, '<td valign="top">great job!!</td>', 'great job!!', '2009-01-19 08:58:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203694, 755199, 83313, '<td valign="top">I expected this to place a little higher, but it appears to have come in not too much under your own estimate. I gave it a 9.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-19 09:02:21.</i></td>', 'I expected this to place a little higher, but it appears to have come in not too much under your own estimate. I gave it a 9.', '2009-01-19 09:02:05.000000', '2009-01-19 09:02:21.000000', 0),
(5203710, 755345, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kind of surprised where this came in, but I am seeing that many of my own votes on this challenge were way off from where they ended up. I gave this a 7.</td>', 'Kind of surprised where this came in, but I am seeing that many of my own votes on this challenge were way off from where they ended up. I gave this a 7.', '2009-01-19 09:06:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203722, 755308, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice zen composition. I like the bright red berries against the pastel background. If there was one thing I''d change, I''d try to get all those pebbles in the front in focus too (i.e. deeper DOF/smaller aperture). Somehow I just find the blurry ones in front a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice zen composition. I like the bright red berries against the pastel background. If there was one thing I''d change, I''d try to get all those pebbles in the front in focus too (i.e. deeper DOF/smaller aperture). Somehow I just find the blurry ones in front a bit distracting.', '2009-01-19 09:10:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203734, 755271, 83313, '<td valign="top">Glad you left some notes. Now I understand why it looks the way it does. It did not strike me as being IR.</td>', 'Glad you left some notes. Now I understand why it looks the way it does. It did not strike me as being IR.', '2009-01-19 09:13:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203742, 755236, 60614, '<td valign="top">Glad to see this one didn''t get below 5 because it really is a great shot.  I am always taking their pictures but I have not got one showing off the design in their backs.  Wonderful capture.  Great bokeh you have going on in the back and you even caught some catchlights in his eye, which gives him life.  Try some black and white processing on this guy to see what you get.</td>', 'Glad to see this one didn''t get below 5 because it really is a great shot.  I am always taking their pictures but I have not got one showing off the design in their backs.  Wonderful capture.  Great bokeh you have going on in the back and you even caught some catchlights in his eye, which gives him life.  Try some black and white processing on this guy to see what you get.', '2009-01-19 09:16:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203747, 755070, 83313, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 6. I was apparently of the minority who saw the vintage advertising look you were going for. Don''t underrate that compact Lumix. 3 out of my 5 top scoring entries were done with my Powershot S5.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-19 09:19:17.</i></td>', 'I gave it a 6. I was apparently of the minority who saw the vintage advertising look you were going for. Don''t underrate that compact Lumix. 3 out of my 5 top scoring entries were done with my Powershot S5.', '2009-01-19 09:18:34.000000', '2009-01-19 09:19:17.000000', 0),
(5203754, 755335, 60614, '<td valign="top">This is so different for you.  I like it.  Very artsy and very underrated.  But hey, at least it stayed in the mid-high fives and not the dreaded fours.  I love the background because it gives an illusion of moving or large brush strokes of a painting which causes the flower to stand out more.  Keep on trying different things.</td>', 'This is so different for you.  I like it.  Very artsy and very underrated.  But hey, at least it stayed in the mid-high fives and not the dreaded fours.  I love the background because it gives an illusion of moving or large brush strokes of a painting which causes the flower to stand out more.  Keep on trying different things.', '2009-01-19 09:20:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203765, 753773, 36006, '<td valign="top">Water is life.</td>', 'Water is life.', '2009-01-19 09:23:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203769, 754770, 83313, '<td valign="top">Fits with some of the other real world documentary sort of images you have entered. It''s different from the usual drop shots and flowers. I had to give it only a 5 because of the image quality, but I really like your approach to showing the real world. Keep it up.</td>', 'Fits with some of the other real world documentary sort of images you have entered. It''s different from the usual drop shots and flowers. I had to give it only a 5 because of the image quality, but I really like your approach to showing the real world. Keep it up.', '2009-01-19 09:24:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203836, 754701, 89723, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot. One of my favorites of all time. Congratulations on a top ten finish. A brilliant capture.</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot. One of my favorites of all time. Congratulations on a top ten finish. A brilliant capture.', '2009-01-19 09:31:28.000000', NULL, 0),
