(5203901, 755347, 20577, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Blackbox:</b></div><hr/><i> Those ''Hoodies'' always remind me of people who are or think they are gangsters. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You wanna be gangsta.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the shot... too bad we both got our butts handed to us in the head to head.</td>', 'Originally posted by Blackbox: Those ''Hoodies'' always remind me of people who are or think they are gangsters.   You wanna be gangsta. Congrats on the shot... too bad we both got our butts handed to us in the head to head.', '2009-01-19 10:07:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203908, 755198, 47852, '<td valign="top">One of my tops during voting.  Glad to hear that you''ll be putting this on your wall... that''s what is most important!  :)</td>', 'One of my tops during voting.  Glad to hear that you''ll be putting this on your wall... that''s what is most important!  :)', '2009-01-19 10:11:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203914, 755250, 47852, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  Love the simplicity, the horizontal lines and shadows, and the way the trees create their own curved lines going vertically.</td>', 'Fantastic!  Love the simplicity, the horizontal lines and shadows, and the way the trees create their own curved lines going vertically.', '2009-01-19 10:13:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203916, 754570, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good week in your household, and I''m betting you''re the talk of all the flies in the yard - they''re stars now!!  As always, excellent macro work.  I especially love how he sat still and let you apply that little water droplet.  He even combed his beard for you!</td>', 'Good week in your household, and I''m betting you''re the talk of all the flies in the yard - they''re stars now!!  As always, excellent macro work.  I especially love how he sat still and let you apply that little water droplet.  He even combed his beard for you!', '2009-01-19 10:14:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203917, 754478, 30982, '<td valign="top">Composition is very strong, and the light and clarity excellent as well.  Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Composition is very strong, and the light and clarity excellent as well.  Congrats on the ribbon!', '2009-01-19 10:14:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203918, 754433, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ribbon and PB all in one shot - outstanding!!  Congrats!!</td>', 'Ribbon and PB all in one shot - outstanding!!  Congrats!!', '2009-01-19 10:15:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203921, 755325, 3724, '<td valign="top">Winter evening view of a gazebo - lit &amp; occupied for a gathering. A skimpy and unusual place to be on a cold night. I like this structure - really interesting shadow forms on the translucent plastic.</td>', 'Winter evening view of a gazebo - lit & occupied for a gathering. A skimpy and unusual place to be on a cold night. I like this structure - really interesting shadow forms on the translucent plastic.', '2009-01-19 10:16:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203922, 755356, 30982, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot, Max, and way to go on an excellent, excellent finish!!  And your dog is an awesome model.</td>', 'Outstanding shot, Max, and way to go on an excellent, excellent finish!!  And your dog is an awesome model.', '2009-01-19 10:17:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203924, 754570, 44877, '<td valign="top">OMG you''re killing me with the vermin! LOL! Congratulations, Roz!!!! So cool - I bet you are excited! Excellent image, though I couldn''t look so closely to really inspect it. And I see you''ve created a monster in Greg who''s right behind you - far out! <br/> <br/>OX</td>', 'OMG you''re killing me with the vermin! LOL! Congratulations, Roz!!!! So cool - I bet you are excited! Excellent image, though I couldn''t look so closely to really inspect it. And I see you''ve created a monster in Greg who''s right behind you - far out!  OX', '2009-01-19 10:17:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203927, 754433, 44877, '<td valign="top">Greg! I''m so excited for you! Congrats on your ribbon - what a wonderful thing. As you may have noticed, I''m not so much into the bugs, but I''m sure this is a brilliant image. :o)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greg! I''m so excited for you! Congrats on your ribbon - what a wonderful thing. As you may have noticed, I''m not so much into the bugs, but I''m sure this is a brilliant image. :o) ', '2009-01-19 10:18:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203933, 754570, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - you did it again.  Damn, girl.  Congrats.</td>', 'WOW - you did it again.  Damn, girl.  Congrats.', '2009-01-19 10:20:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203935, 754701, 47852, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, and one of my top picks from the challenge.  Love the simplicity of this shot, and the fact that you left so much space around the man to help the feeling of isolation and sadness that is on his face.  Something about the way he is framed with the corners of the tables and posters all pointing towards him, with his round table and round mug is intriguing too.  Congrats on the top 10 and the Posthumous blue!</td>', 'Wonderful shot, and one of my top picks from the challenge.  Love the simplicity of this shot, and the fact that you left so much space around the man to help the feeling of isolation and sadness that is on his face.  Something about the way he is framed with the corners of the tables and posters all pointing towards him, with his round table and round mug is intriguing too.  Congrats on the top 10 and the Posthumous blue!', '2009-01-19 10:21:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203936, 755356, 15711, '<td valign="top">This was hands down the finest doggy shot I''ve ever seen.  I just loved it.  I think it deserved a ribbon.<br/> <br/>Fabulous finish.</td>', 'This was hands down the finest doggy shot I''ve ever seen.  I just loved it.  I think it deserved a ribbon. Fabulous finish.', '2009-01-19 10:21:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203937, 754941, 99981, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by srugolo:</b></div><hr/><i> That''s underrated for sure... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree!</td>', 'Originally posted by srugolo: That''s underrated for sure...   I agree!', '2009-01-19 10:22:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5203939, 754701, 15711, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite shot along with the number 4 spot.  Just outstanding.  The tones and the mood - wow, Deb.  Congrats on top 10</td>', 'This was my favorite shot along with the number 4 spot.  Just outstanding.  The tones and the mood - wow, Deb.  Congrats on top 10', '2009-01-19 10:22:37.000000', NULL, 0),
