(5203965, 755356, 67697, '<td valign="top">I did not finish voting so I did not get to this photo.  How adorable!  What a sweet face.  She loves her daddy!  Congrats on 4th place and a new PB!!</td>', 'I did not finish voting so I did not get to this photo.  How adorable!  What a sweet face.  She loves her daddy!  Congrats on 4th place and a new PB!!', '2009-01-19 10:34:10.000000', NULL, 0),
