(5204140, 755324, 68947, '<td valign="top">WHOA...this scored WAY too low IMHO!!!<br/> <br/>The number of 1,2,3 and 4''s are just ridiculous.  It''s a tremendous photo and very well shot.  It certainly deserves a much higher score even if voters didn''t see it as "life". I''ve seen so many shots shoehorned into a challenge that just because it was well done, got far higher than this.  <br/> <br/>Sorry, Jo but, it is a beautiful shot and you should put it proudly, right on the front page of your portfolio! :)<br/> <br/>ETA:  Perhaps, had you named it, "Life In Frozen Suspension", people might have gotten it??? ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-19 12:07:08.</i></td>', 'WHOA...this scored WAY too low IMHO!!! The number of 1,2,3 and 4''s are just ridiculous.  It''s a tremendous photo and very well shot.  It certainly deserves a much higher score even if voters didn''t see it as "life". I''ve seen so many shots shoehorned into a challenge that just because it was well done, got far higher than this.   Sorry, Jo but, it is a beautiful shot and you should put it proudly, right on the front page of your portfolio! :) ETA:  Perhaps, had you named it, "Life In Frozen Suspension", people might have gotten it??? ;)', '2009-01-19 12:05:25.000000', '2009-01-19 12:07:08.000000', 0),
