(5204775, 754433, 70514, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a front page image, and even more so to share it with Roz.  You know what they say... anything boys can do, girls can do better :)  (gosh that thing is gross,lol)</td>', 'Congratulations on a front page image, and even more so to share it with Roz.  You know what they say... anything boys can do, girls can do better :)  (gosh that thing is gross,lol)', '2009-01-19 17:06:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5204781, 754701, 70514, '<td valign="top">Deb,<br/> <br/>Outstanding image, full of wonder and interest.  I love how you processed this.  Beautiful.<br/> <br/>Charlene</td>', 'Deb, Outstanding image, full of wonder and interest.  I love how you processed this.  Beautiful. Charlene', '2009-01-19 17:07:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5204785, 754058, 70514, '<td valign="top">Wow!  It looks like a studio shot, the lighting is so dramatic with the surrounding.  Wonderfully done.  I do believe he was waiting for you.</td>', 'Wow!  It looks like a studio shot, the lighting is so dramatic with the surrounding.  Wonderfully done.  I do believe he was waiting for you.', '2009-01-19 17:08:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5204791, 754772, 70514, '<td valign="top">I just love the slant of the door and how she''s leaning against it.  Absolutely beautiful dog, gorgeous eyes</td>', 'I just love the slant of the door and how she''s leaning against it.  Absolutely beautiful dog, gorgeous eyes', '2009-01-19 17:10:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5204796, 755129, 70514, '<td valign="top">This image makes me smile.  Lovely and playful, full of life without a doubt.</td>', 'This image makes me smile.  Lovely and playful, full of life without a doubt.', '2009-01-19 17:11:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5204800, 755251, 70514, '<td valign="top">I love the lines of the cactus as a repeating pattern.  Absolutely wonderful choice in b/w.</td>', 'I love the lines of the cactus as a repeating pattern.  Absolutely wonderful choice in b/w.', '2009-01-19 17:12:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5204803, 753773, 83080, '<td valign="top">Actually, I''d bet there are micro-organisms in that water.  I tried the personification of a water drop about a year ago just for the fun of it and ended up with the same results:<br/>(Virgin Mary water drop)<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=575476" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/730/120/575476.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/730/120/575476.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/730/120/575476.jpg"/></a> <br/>I''m sure there are some catholics somewhere that still light candles and pray in front of my picture.<br/> <br/>Love the power bokeh in your shot.</td>', 'Actually, I''d bet there are micro-organisms in that water.  I tried the personification of a water drop about a year ago just for the fun of it and ended up with the same results:(Virgin Mary water drop) I''m sure there are some catholics somewhere that still light candles and pray in front of my picture. Love the power bokeh in your shot.', '2009-01-19 17:12:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5204836, 754437, 63633, '<td valign="top">Just to clarify to other readers, I specifically asked Judi to critique this shot, and she seriously came through for me - thanks a million Judi!</td>', 'Just to clarify to other readers, I specifically asked Judi to critique this shot, and she seriously came through for me - thanks a million Judi!', '2009-01-19 17:23:04.000000', NULL, 0),
