(5205138, 754741, 54645, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> Top Ten!   Congrats, Ben... I never woulda thunk it... but I''m so glad it did! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Feel the emotion Lydia! Come over to the dark side of dogs, leave the turtles and frogs behind. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-19 19:38:11.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: Top Ten!   Congrats, Ben... I never woulda thunk it... but I''m so glad it did!   Feel the emotion Lydia! Come over to the dark side of dogs, leave the turtles and frogs behind. ', '2009-01-19 19:38:00.000000', '2009-01-19 19:38:11.000000', 0),
(5205144, 753422, 54645, '<td valign="top">See...Art thinks she is pregnant too! I love her intense stare, as if she is going to run right through me.</td>', 'See...Art thinks she is pregnant too! I love her intense stare, as if she is going to run right through me.', '2009-01-19 19:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5205199, 755330, 12076, '<td valign="top">Those that scored this low must have been part of some sort of ''focus group''!  The red and the title certainly enhance the feeling of a beating heart.</td>', 'Those that scored this low must have been part of some sort of ''focus group''!  The red and the title certainly enhance the feeling of a beating heart.', '2009-01-19 20:10:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5205211, 755286, 3724, '<td valign="top">handsome environment 8 - lush, icy good sculpture or consider as a frozen <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=146162" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">derivative</a></td>', 'handsome environment 8 - lush, icy good sculpture or consider as a frozen derivative', '2009-01-19 20:18:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5205214, 754838, 62187, '<td valign="top">Hey Judi,<br/> <br/>It''s funny: flies carry death to living creatures and the fish has no life left in it. How ironic - I hope you understand what I''m talking about. It''s a good thing I like irony. I had your photo pegged as a different entry which only goes to show how much I know. Good to see you at the top. So, was it some kind of filter or not?</td>', 'Hey Judi, It''s funny: flies carry death to living creatures and the fish has no life left in it. How ironic - I hope you understand what I''m talking about. It''s a good thing I like irony. I had your photo pegged as a different entry which only goes to show how much I know. Good to see you at the top. So, was it some kind of filter or not?', '2009-01-19 20:22:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5205252, 755182, 62187, '<td valign="top">Something must be wrong. While this photo is totally crisp and clear, there are many more photos above this one that I thought were clearly out of focus or mostly just not sharp. Does this mean your back? I hope so...I know I ticked some people off and I think you may have been one of them. I''ve always thought that you were like one of the ''citizen police'' and commanded and gave respect to all.</td>', 'Something must be wrong. While this photo is totally crisp and clear, there are many more photos above this one that I thought were clearly out of focus or mostly just not sharp. Does this mean your back? I hope so...I know I ticked some people off and I think you may have been one of them. I''ve always thought that you were like one of the ''citizen police'' and commanded and gave respect to all.', '2009-01-19 20:40:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5205258, 755327, 62187, '<td valign="top">WHAT...!!!!!!! What a rip-off!</td>', 'WHAT...!!!!!!! What a rip-off!', '2009-01-19 20:43:14.000000', NULL, 0),
