(5205290, 755378, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>gloriously green, hectic, dynamic, sharp and soft--just like Life...</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!gloriously green, hectic, dynamic, sharp and soft--just like Life...', '2009-01-19 20:55:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5205293, 754650, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>extraordinarily well seen image, luminous and intriguing<br/>(ignore the yawn)</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!extraordinarily well seen image, luminous and intriguing(ignore the yawn)', '2009-01-19 20:56:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5205299, 754915, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>layered, textured, luminous and wonderful</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!layered, textured, luminous and wonderful', '2009-01-19 20:56:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5205306, 755226, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>superbly stark, luminous, textured, layered, and so intriguing: struggle and hope depicted with such subtlety</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!superbly stark, luminous, textured, layered, and so intriguing: struggle and hope depicted with such subtlety', '2009-01-19 20:59:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5205313, 755250, 53814, '<td valign="top">A great photo André. Life depending entirely upon the man-made cages, a prayer, to keep out the hungry deer. A tough life on the tree farm, and you have captured it brilliantly.</td>', 'A great photo André. Life depending entirely upon the man-made cages, a prayer, to keep out the hungry deer. A tough life on the tree farm, and you have captured it brilliantly.', '2009-01-19 21:02:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5205316, 754670, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>at first glance a simple, wonderful image of a pretty girl, but so much more<br/>perfect control of tone, contrast--with all those highlights in the background, SHE remains the highlight (as it should be) <br/>microphones and stands blend with the background--present enough so we know they are there, but not distracting or dominant in the composition<br/>and a nice little surprise--the background singer blending with with background.<br/> <br/>capturing that smile, with her hand just <i>so</i>, really pushes this image to the top</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!at first glance a simple, wonderful image of a pretty girl, but so much moreperfect control of tone, contrast--with all those highlights in the background, SHE remains the highlight (as it should be) microphones and stands blend with the background--present enough so we know they are there, but not distracting or dominant in the compositionand a nice little surprise--the background singer blending with with background. capturing that smile, with her hand just so, really pushes this image to the top', '2009-01-19 21:03:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5205322, 754924, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>as always, you demonstrate absolute mastery of technique combined with wonderful creative vision<br/>(and the outtake is breath-taking, as well)</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!as always, you demonstrate absolute mastery of technique combined with wonderful creative vision(and the outtake is breath-taking, as well)', '2009-01-19 21:05:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5205325, 753595, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>Such a superb image, luminous, soft, lovely--floating and glowing and graceful</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!Such a superb image, luminous, soft, lovely--floating and glowing and graceful', '2009-01-19 21:06:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5205333, 755250, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>This is extraordinarily beautiful: luminous, layered, lovely lines that feel so peacefully languid, masterful control of tone, texture, exposure, and excellent choice on extra foreground, to add the lonely context to the composition</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!This is extraordinarily beautiful: luminous, layered, lovely lines that feel so peacefully languid, masterful control of tone, texture, exposure, and excellent choice on extra foreground, to add the lonely context to the composition', '2009-01-19 21:09:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5205344, 754903, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award WINNER!<br/>This is extraordinarily well seen, well executed, and stands independent of any challenge theme.  Not a single false step or choice in this image.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award WINNER!This is extraordinarily well seen, well executed, and stands independent of any challenge theme.  Not a single false step or choice in this image.', '2009-01-19 21:11:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5205360, 754701, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award WINNER!<br/>can''t add much to the comments already provided, except to say that this is a MEMORABLE image--I won''t have to come back here and look it up again: it exists permanently in my memory, to enjoy whenever and wherever I wish.  And this is the work of a Master.  Plain and simple, a Master.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award WINNER!can''t add much to the comments already provided, except to say that this is a MEMORABLE image--I won''t have to come back here and look it up again: it exists permanently in my memory, to enjoy whenever and wherever I wish.  And this is the work of a Master.  Plain and simple, a Master.', '2009-01-19 21:15:56.000000', NULL, 0),
