(5225943, 755204, 39057, '<td valign="top">Although a good action shot, ducks hardly ever ribbon here on DPC. I have a duck called the ConDUCKtor that I though would ribbon but it didn''t.</td>', 'Although a good action shot, ducks hardly ever ribbon here on DPC. I have a duck called the ConDUCKtor that I though would ribbon but it didn''t.', '2009-01-29 11:16:50.000000', NULL, 0),
