(5230420, 754741, 70514, '<td valign="top">Goreous lighting and processing.  So much emotion in those eyes.</td>', 'Goreous lighting and processing.  So much emotion in those eyes.', '2009-02-01 01:38:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5230455, 754650, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sometimes reaching the few is far better than pleasing the most.  You received comments from some of the best "appreciators" on DPC - Ed (e301), Paul (ubique), Andre (undieyatch); AND a Chromeydome award.  And I''ve been back to view this one several times since the challenge.  You do good stuff.</td>', 'Sometimes reaching the few is far better than pleasing the most.  You received comments from some of the best "appreciators" on DPC - Ed (e301), Paul (ubique), Andre (undieyatch); AND a Chromeydome award.  And I''ve been back to view this one several times since the challenge.  You do good stuff.', '2009-02-01 01:49:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5235166, 754701, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice shot ... it makes me wonder why I can''t spot scenes like this what I''m out and about.  i guess it relates to having two under-3''s with me most of the time.  Fantastic shot.</td>', 'Nice shot ... it makes me wonder why I can''t spot scenes like this what I''m out and about.  i guess it relates to having two under-3''s with me most of the time.  Fantastic shot.', '2009-02-02 13:36:01.000000', NULL, 0);
