(5240028, 754866, 31637, '<td valign="top">What a feeling it must be to zoom in and capture such a shot like this! Awesome sense of just crusing by, nice exposure and sharpness.</td>', 'What a feeling it must be to zoom in and capture such a shot like this! Awesome sense of just crusing by, nice exposure and sharpness.', '2009-02-04 22:30:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5241587, 754650, 86447, '<td valign="top">What <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a> said.   Listen to her.<br/> <br/>Perhaps a bit brighter with less noise and this would have been a winner.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-05 21:26:53.</i></td>', 'What  Melethia said.   Listen to her. Perhaps a bit brighter with less noise and this would have been a winner.', '2009-02-05 21:26:21.000000', '2009-02-05 21:26:53.000000', 0),
(5241968, 754308, 31637, '<td valign="top">Yes they move very fast ! Make sure your sunlight is strong and boost that shutter speed !!</td>', 'Yes they move very fast ! Make sure your sunlight is strong and boost that shutter speed !!', '2009-02-06 03:29:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5243374, 754570, 70828, '<td valign="top">Awesome, as usual!</td>', 'Awesome, as usual!', '2009-02-07 03:48:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245353, 755396, 67697, '<td valign="top">heh!  just saw this now.  you are funny.  nice doggy!  lol  actually i like what the processing did to the background.  it''s cool that you can see some leaves.  almost like a forest in a blizzard, with a crazy dog running amok.  :D</td>', 'heh!  just saw this now.  you are funny.  nice doggy!  lol  actually i like what the processing did to the background.  it''s cool that you can see some leaves.  almost like a forest in a blizzard, with a crazy dog running amok.  :D', '2009-02-08 14:10:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5254277, 755378, 75034, '<td valign="top">Hey Robert, I have to be honest with you and tell you that I gave this shot a 3. Although it fit the challenge as being life I couldn''t see the relevance of the title in relation to the shot. (that''s not why I voted it a 3) I found it hard to relate to your shot on a creative level. Not only did it not hold my interest but I found it to be something of a snap shot and it lacked focus and composition. <br/> <br/>That was my initial reaction to your shot. Now, that being said and now knowing that it was a lens baby shot, I''m able to see the photographic merit to your entry. If only we knew this during the voting I think the outcome would have been different.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Hey Robert, I have to be honest with you and tell you that I gave this shot a 3. Although it fit the challenge as being life I couldn''t see the relevance of the title in relation to the shot. (that''s not why I voted it a 3) I found it hard to relate to your shot on a creative level. Not only did it not hold my interest but I found it to be something of a snap shot and it lacked focus and composition.  That was my initial reaction to your shot. Now, that being said and now knowing that it was a lens baby shot, I''m able to see the photographic merit to your entry. If only we knew this during the voting I think the outcome would have been different. All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-02-12 23:28:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5254301, 755286, 75034, '<td valign="top">Hello Chief how''s it going? I liked your shot in voting and have done the same thing you did when I got my new glass last year. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=631376" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/75034/120/631376.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/75034/120/631376.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/75034/120/631376.jpg"/></a> I was able to bring up out the bokeh a lot by adjusting the exposure and saturation as well as the blacks and found the shot had more pop to it. That''s what I thought was missing from this shot was the enhanced background. Otherwise as I first said I liked your photo.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Hello Chief how''s it going? I liked your shot in voting and have done the same thing you did when I got my new glass last year.  I was able to bring up out the bokeh a lot by adjusting the exposure and saturation as well as the blacks and found the shot had more pop to it. That''s what I thought was missing from this shot was the enhanced background. Otherwise as I first said I liked your photo. All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-02-12 23:44:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5256765, 754701, 62249, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. The lighting on his face is great. I might''ve tried a slightly closer crop to make him a little larger in the frame, but not so much as to lose the mood of the coffee shop.</td>', 'Excellent capture. The lighting on his face is great. I might''ve tried a slightly closer crop to make him a little larger in the frame, but not so much as to lose the mood of the coffee shop.', '2009-02-14 19:24:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5260135, 754701, 75034, '<td valign="top">Hello Deb, I know this took me a while but I''ve been quite busy.<br/> <br/>This was one of my highest votes and I picked it to be in the top ten easily. I really love the composition and your choice to use B&amp;W with the blue overtones, it lends a calming quality to your photograph. I think that your subject choice for this shot was smack on, I don''t think a teenager, family, a woman, or even a younger man would have had the same impact as this older gentleman. One is left wondering what he could be thinking and how his lifes journey brought him to that spot at that time in his life. The Lighting and focus are fantastic not to mention your title fits to perfection. Congratulations on another top ten finish and I hope your able to run into this gentleman again and offer him a print I think he would be thrilled with it.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours Deb.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Hello Deb, I know this took me a while but I''ve been quite busy. This was one of my highest votes and I picked it to be in the top ten easily. I really love the composition and your choice to use B&W with the blue overtones, it lends a calming quality to your photograph. I think that your subject choice for this shot was smack on, I don''t think a teenager, family, a woman, or even a younger man would have had the same impact as this older gentleman. One is left wondering what he could be thinking and how his lifes journey brought him to that spot at that time in his life. The Lighting and focus are fantastic not to mention your title fits to perfection. Congratulations on another top ten finish and I hope your able to run into this gentleman again and offer him a print I think he would be thrilled with it. All the best to you and yours Deb. MAX!', '2009-02-17 08:34:45.000000', NULL, 0),
