(5269391, 755067, 65858, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!</td>', 'Fantastic!', '2009-02-22 22:16:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5273974, 755129, 75034, '<td valign="top">Michelle, Ah the memories... the snow down the back of your coat, snow all over your face, in your gloves, the hurt pride, not to mention the constant scene <br/> <br/>recreation in your mind, trying to figure out why you didn''t fly through the air like a plane coning in for a landing. Was there sabotage, was there foul play,was <br/> <br/>there a sibling involved in this scenario and were they smiling happily as they watched this scene unfold? No matter, your photograph says it all, what ever this <br/> <br/>young man thought was going to happen, how ever grandiose, came crashing down along with his pride.<br/> <br/>Great capture.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Michelle, Ah the memories... the snow down the back of your coat, snow all over your face, in your gloves, the hurt pride, not to mention the constant scene  recreation in your mind, trying to figure out why you didn''t fly through the air like a plane coning in for a landing. Was there sabotage, was there foul play,was  there a sibling involved in this scenario and were they smiling happily as they watched this scene unfold? No matter, your photograph says it all, what ever this  young man thought was going to happen, how ever grandiose, came crashing down along with his pride. Great capture. All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-02-25 08:36:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5276920, 755247, 75034, '<td valign="top">Hello Kelli, sorry to take so long to get to you for my commenting but better late then never.<br/> <br/>I like the eyes and the angle of the shot. I wonder if you processed this in B&amp;W if it would have been more of a hit with the voters? <br/> <br/>There is a definite snap shot feel to this photo and I wonder if that was your intention?<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Hello Kelli, sorry to take so long to get to you for my commenting but better late then never. I like the eyes and the angle of the shot. I wonder if you processed this in B&W if it would have been more of a hit with the voters?  There is a definite snap shot feel to this photo and I wonder if that was your intention? All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-02-26 20:45:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5276928, 755070, 75034, '<td valign="top">Dennis, sorry to be so long in handing out the comments, but sometimes you just run short on time.<br/> <br/>I have no idea why this didn''t do better with the voters, I thought it had a wonderful down home feel to the shot and the sepia tones added just the right touch of nostalgia. <br/> <br/>I thought your subject matter was great the lighting was spot on and the composition worked well, I scored it a 7.<br/> <br/>IMHO you were robbed.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Dennis, sorry to be so long in handing out the comments, but sometimes you just run short on time. I have no idea why this didn''t do better with the voters, I thought it had a wonderful down home feel to the shot and the sepia tones added just the right touch of nostalgia.  I thought your subject matter was great the lighting was spot on and the composition worked well, I scored it a 7. IMHO you were robbed. All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-02-26 20:52:47.000000', NULL, 0),
