(5462167, 755340, 60614, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and the S curve of the pea vine.  The blue of the pot and window draws your eys to the string of green peas.  As for the pot, I like the shine to the pot.  It adds more interest because of the reflections.  I am sure a matte finish would have made the peas stand out more but I have always liked seeing more than one thing in a photo.  Thank you for your encouragments.  I will heed your advice.</td>', 'I love the composition and the S curve of the pea vine.  The blue of the pot and window draws your eys to the string of green peas.  As for the pot, I like the shine to the pot.  It adds more interest because of the reflections.  I am sure a matte finish would have made the peas stand out more but I have always liked seeing more than one thing in a photo.  Thank you for your encouragments.  I will heed your advice.', '2009-05-01 20:34:28.000000', NULL, 0),
